ovides incredible flexibility?complete with its own bathroom, built-in office, and private exterior access. Whether used as a guest suite, home office, gym, media room, or creative studio, this space is a true bonus. Step outside to a spacious backyard patio with a pool, spa, and built-in BBQ?an entertainer?s dream where you can host unforgettable gatherings or unwind in peace while taking in the unobstructed views. Enjoy warm evenings by the outdoor fire pit, or cozy up in the private courtyard around a charming fireplace.  Additional features include a 3-car oversized garage and all the peace, privacy, and prestige of life behind the gates of Rolling Hills. Community schools are excellent and within the Equestrian inspired City of Rolling Hills are 26 miles of trails, two riding rings and tennis and pickleball courts. With 3 separate 24/7 attended gates, Rolling Hills offers less traffic while enjoying incredible views and a rural lifestyle. Easy access to all other Southbay and Los Angeles cities for dining and beaches and easy access to the 110 freeway. The Palos Verdes Peninsula also offers local shopping and dining options and incredible parks and vistas from them all! Don?t miss this one-of-a-kind property where luxury, flexibility, and views come together in the most picturesque way.","Concrete, Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Attic, Basement, Bonus Room, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Great Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Loft, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Media Room, Office, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Property is on temporarly on HOLD, call agents for more information. Mike (310)701-0224 Heidi (310)971-0970","False","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","True","4805","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Bowie","","12","Road","","Ranch, Traditional","Cash, Cash t