"No Interior Steps","2.369","Please be prepared to provide information to LA concerning buyers' ability to purchase this home. Brokers Open 5/16 and individual appointments offered starting early June. Thank you.","Dishwasher, Gas Oven, Microwave, Refrigerator","True","166 - Rolling Hills","Unknown","True","7567017047","Pickleball, Tennis Court(s), Hiking Trails, Horse Trails, Management","8000","","False","8","2","","","6","6","","Rolling Hills","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Other","","","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","87","8000000","#ERR","04/10/2023 8:03:07 PM","","","07/24/2023 12:00:00 AM","07/24/2023 3:26:14 PM","06/06/2023 12:00:00 AM","","04/06/2023 12:00:00 AM","","04/26/2023 12:01:11 PM","","07/24/2023 12:00:00 AM","07/24/2023 12:00:00 AM","South","87","French Doors","False","Area, Breakfast Counter / Bar, Dining Room","Barbecue Private","","Good Condition","True","","","Living Room, Primary Bedroom, Gas, Fire Pit","True","Tile, Wood","True","Central, Fireplace(s), Forced Air","True","Beamed Ceilings, Cathedral Ceiling(s), Granite Counters, High Ceilings","True","True","","None","False","","","","33.752855","Individual Room, Inside","True","False","","CC And R's, Easements","8000000","","","8000000","#ERR","310.426.8811","","clint.patterson@gmail.com","310.541.3062","Clint","","","Patterson","","VPATTCLI","","","","","V7804","310-544-3071","Berkshire Hathaway HomeService","310-544-5091","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.35341","","6","103193.64","0-1 Unit/Acre, Garden, Gentle Sloping, Horse Property Unimproved, Landscaped, Lot Over 40000 Sqft, Irregular Lot, Sprinklers Drip System, Yard","Hiking , Horse Trails, Preserve/Public Land","Gated with Attendant, Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Gated Community, Gated with Guard, Smoke Detector(s)","Assessor","","","PV23059384","","3","8","3","1","Owner","Jane Lau","","310-774-1666","Guest House Detached","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Driveway - Brick, Garage Faces Side, Private, Workshop in Garage","True","Patio, Front Porch, Wrap Around","True","47","","Private, Fenced, Heated, In Ground","True","","1782.53","Looking for a home with some of the best ocean views in Los Angeles County? Do you want to live in a tranquil gated community with attendants on duty 24 hours/day? Walk out of your door onto miles of private, lush hiking and horseback riding trails?  Here is your home: a private hillside retreat, sitting on well over 2 acres overlooking nature reserves, ravines, and miles of spectacular coastline + Catalina Island. There are stunning views from the home as well as the pool deck, patios, orchards and guest house/ADU. The main house boasts 4 bedrooms and 5.5 bathrooms, while a 2 bed/2 bath guest house (ADU) w/ kitchenette and ocean-facing patio offers additional lodging. Features include vaulted ceilings, rich wood details, and large windows overlooking the Pacific. The great room is an entertainer's dream: a handsome plank and timber ceilings, a six-seater wet bar and distinctive indoor fire pit. The dining area is a towering space with French doors opening onto a peaceful courtyard. You can listen to the burbling fountain and admire the extraordinary views. Adjoining the dining room is a kitchen packed with contemporary stainless Viking appliances, custom cabinetry and granite countertops. You'll love spending time in a kitchen that is both functional and attractive.  Most of the home's north wing is dedicated to a massive en-suite: a large private lounge featuring a fireplace, custom built-ins, and some of the home's most spectacular ocean views; dual walk-in closets; and dual bathrooms, each boasting a large vanity, walk-in shower, separate tub, and luxurious bidet. At the other end of the home you will find additional bedrooms (the amazing views) and bathrooms, the laundry room, as well as access to the spacious garage (complete with built-ins and work space).  The amazing grounds will never fail to lure you out into the California sunshine. It is replete with sweeping sundecks, meandering paths, shady benches and sitting areas, verdant landscaping, fruit trees (including an orchard complete with drip irrigation), a secluded hot tub, and many more hidden treasures. Take a dip in the large swimming pool, prepare meals in the outdoor kitchen and spend evenings around the gas fire pit admiring the twinkling RPV city lights below. Additional features of the home include space for equestrian accommodations, and much more.  A bonus: 13 Cinchring is located near great schools, shopping, parks, hiking trails, and equestrian facilities.","Tile","Bonus Room, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, See Remarks, Separate Family Room, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","2","%","","","False","Full Service","Buyers agents please contact Jane Lau: 310-774-1666 for appointments.  Brokers Open 5/16 - please bring your clients. Individual appointments to view will be available early June. We have limitations to certain days based upon family/childcare needs. Thank you for your understanding.","","None","False","True","4488","Appraiser","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Cinchring Road","","13","","","Spanish","Cash to New Loan","","26343","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Water Connected","Canyon, Catalina, City Lights, Coastline, Hills, Ocean, Orchard","True","","","","1974","90274","",""
"","5.4894","","","","166 - Rolling Hills","Unknown","True","7567016015","Tennis Court(s), Hiking Trails, Horse Trails, Controlled Access","2300","","False","9","2","","2","5","6","","Rolling Hills","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Pager Ph","Agent Fax","Agent Voice Mail","Agent Email","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","99","13800000","#ERR","10/20/2025 7:41:42 AM","","","01/27/2026 12:00:00 AM","01/27/2026 9:47:30 AM","","","10/20/2025 12:00:00 AM","","10/20/2025 2:59:47 PM","","01/27/2026 12:00:00 AM","","","99","","False","Dining Room","","","","","","","Family Room, Living Room","True","","True","Central","True","","True","True","","None","False","","","","33.751687","Individual Room","True","False","","","13800000","","","13800000","#ERR","310-493-7216","","chris@chrisadlam.com","","Chris","","","Adlam","","VADLACHR","","","","","V8107","310-265-8889","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","310-541-8271","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.343644","","57","239120","Lot Over 40000 Sqft","Biking , Golf, Hiking , Horse Trails, Stable(s)","Gated with Attendant","Assessor","","","PV25243012","","5","5","","1","Owner","","","","","Circular Driveway, Porte-Cochere","True","Brick","True","36","","Private","True","","1937.39","This landmark Crest Road estate is set on approximately 5.5 usable acres, and is one of the very few properties in Rolling Hills offering views in three directions; city lights and coastline to the north, harbor to the east, and ocean and Catalina to the south.  Perched above the street with a commanding presence, the home enjoys tremendous curb appeal. A sweeping driveway sets the stage, leading to the elegant porte-coch?re, spacious motor court, and a five-car garage.  The huge, park-like backyard is truly impressive, showcasing a large pool and spa, expansive lawn, a double bocce ball court, and a barn with riding ring below.  Inside, the home exudes a sense of elegance and grandeur, with generous living spaces designed to capture the views. The living room overlooks the rolling front lawn with sweeping vistas of the ocean and Catalina, while the spacious family room opens to the backyard with its dazzling city lights and coastline views beyond. The bedroom wing includes five bedrooms, each with its own full bathroom, providing comfort and privacy for family and guests alike. The oversized primary suite serves as a private retreat, offering a luxurious sense of space and privacy.  The separate guest casita enjoys a bedroom, kitchenette and cozy living space.  Additional highlights include a screening room, a gym, sauna and a temperature-controlled wine cellar. With its exceptional setting, rare multi-view orientation, and expansive grounds, this property presents a remarkable opportunity to own one of Rolling Hills? signature estates, ready to enjoy as is or to tailor to your vision.  This is the one you?ve been waiting for?","","Family Room, Formal Entry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please TEXT Valerie for an appointment:  310.704.5164","False","Private","True","","7123","Estimated","","CA","Canceled","One","","E","Crest","","34","","","","Cash to New Loan","","L","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","","1971","90274","",""
