he dining room, and multiple outdoor patio areas to take in the panoramic views. The lot offers privacy and great potential for landscaping. Parking is abundant, featuring an attached 2-car garage at the front with two side-by-side parking spaces directly in front of it and an additional 1-car garage at the back with two more side-by-side parking spaces, providing a total capacity for up to seven vehicles. A true diamond in the rough, this home presents a unique opportunity to update and personalize while preserving its original charm or modernize it to suit your style. The multiple access points to the outdoor space invite endless possibilities for exploration, relaxation, and adventure, adding to the warmth and allure of this one-of-a-kind property.","Shingle","Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Separate Family Room, Sun","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Easy to show, appointment only - TEXT Angela 310-402-3250. Provide your name, DRE Lic#, company name along with date and time you'll like to show.","False","None","False","","3576","Public Records","","CA","Canceled","Three Or More , Multi/Split ","","E","Palos Verdes","","27772","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional, FHA, Submit, VA Loan","","19028","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Harbor, Hills, Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic, Peek-A-Boo, Trees/Woods, Water","True","","","Screens","1962","90275","5149","RPRS20000&E*"
