ters, marble and stone flooring, formal dining room with views. There is also a laundry room and powder room on the first level. Upstairs, retreat to the primary suite with walk-in closet, fireplace and balcony to enjoy the views. The primary bath features dual sinks and custom tiled shower. The terraced rear yard has numerous mature fruit trees including: tangerine, fig, grapefruit, avocado, lemon, apricot, grapes, and guava. Residents have access to the top-ranked Palos Verdes Schools such as Mira Catalina Elementary, Miraleste Intermediate, and your choice from two of the top ranked high schools in California. Epic views and priceless sunrises...","","Den, Entry, Family Room, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Peninsula","Miraleste","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Appointment only owners have dogs tax records show  2280 sq ft. breeze way enclosed without permit and new sq ft is 2957","","","","","2957","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Grandpoint","","30040","Lane","","","Contract","","0000000","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Harbor, Hills, Marina, Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Panoramic, Vincent Thomas Bridge","True","https://www.zillow.com/view-3d-home/e428ef1b-13cc-44c9-8fe2-45aa618a5dfd?setAttribution=mls&wl=true","https://www.zillow.com/view-3d-home/e428ef1b-13cc-44c9-8fe2-45aa618a5dfd?setAttribution=mls&wl=true","","1967","90275","6426","RPRS20000*"
