ewport Beach from this exclusive property. Located at the end and atop a quiet cul-de-sac with over 20,000 sq ft in lot size, this spacious 2-story home offers ultimate privacy while large, picturesque windows and sliding doors on both levels of the house maximize the fantastic views. The MAIN LEVEL includes a porch leading to a large welcoming foyer, where you can set the tone for your future home. A cozy living room has large view windows complimented by a cozy fireplace. The formal dining room has a sliding door to the backyard, and opens to the kitchen with ample cabinet space and a breakfast nook. There are two bedrooms on the main level - a primary suite has French doors to the outside while its en-suite bathroom has a double sink vanity and linen closet. The other bedroom has large corner windows to take in the view, and is conveniently adjacent to a hallway bathroom.  ON THE UPPER LEVEL, the secluded primary suite features a walk-in closet, storage area and a private view balcony. The luxurious primary bathroom boasts a double sink vanity, privacy toilet door, separate tub and large shower. For relaxation, there is an expansive family room with a wall of large view windows to capture the magnificent view and ocean breeze. It also boasts a tall, open beam cathedral ceiling, a large fireplace, and access to the view balcony.  In addition, there is a recreation room with a wet bar and balcony access or additional entertainment. Together, there is a potential to remodel the area into a 4th view bedroom en-suite and a functional family room.  Meanwhile, you can also find plenty of storage from the walk-up attic or the oversized garage that can fit up to three cars. Outdoor amenities include a swimming pool and spa, covered patio and BBQ station, a spacious side yard, and a view terrace with a firepit. This house is to be sold ?As Is? and is priced accordingly.  If you are looking for a fixer to create your dream home, the time is now to make this extraordinary property your very own.","","Entry, Foyer, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Recreation, Separate Family Room, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Palos Verdes","Miraleste","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","The Seller just moved out and house is vacant. Just go and use the Supra Lockbox at the front door to show it.","True","Private, In Ground","True","","3429","Taped","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Suana","","2053","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","23438","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Harbor, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic, Vincent Thomas Bridge","True","","","Blinds, Double Pane Windows, Drapes","1959","90275","6362","RPRS20000*"
