, this residence offers stunning panoramic views of the harbor, ocean, mountains, and coastline from nearly every room. Step inside this 4 bedroom, 2.5 bathroom,  approx. 2300 sqft home to find smooth ceilings enhanced by new ceiling fans, air conditioning, and fresh paint throughout, lending a modern touch to the space. The home is equipped with new double-paned vinyl tempered glass windows and doors, including a stylish new front door glass that welcomes you in. The primary bedroom is a retreat with its striking wood plank ceiling and incredible views, while the dining room walls exudes elegance with its knotty pine wood planks. Rich wood flooring extends throughout the home, adding warmth and character to every room. Both bathrooms have been meticulously renovated with new tile, vanities, toilets, and fixtures. The hall bath features an enlarged shower, and the primary bath boasts, two new vanities, a remodeled shower/tub combination, complete with heated towel racks, ceiling heaters, and exhaust fans. New closets with mirror doors and sun-sensitive drapery throughout further enhance the home?s appeal. Significant updates include the replacement of the old septic system with new drain lines and a city sewer connection. The kitchen has been upgraded with new appliances, including a stovetop, microwave oven, and two refrigerators (one in the garage for additional storage). Exterior improvements include fresh paint, new wood shutters, updated landscaping with new plants and trees, a new sprinkler system, and a newly fenced backyard with chain-link fencing. The sparkling pool has been replastered, with the deep end raised from 10.5 feet to 5.5 feet. New pool equipment, decking, and raised block walls create a refreshing and inviting outdoor space. The double-car garage has been expanded to accommodate a workbench and extra storage and features a rear door for convenient backyard access. Close proximity to shopping, entertainment, medical offices, beaches, shopping, and freeway access. This special home must be seen in person to be fully appreciated. Don?t miss the opportunity to make it yours!","","Entry, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please text LA your contact information, date and time of showing and wait for confirmation. Thank you!! 310.738.6775","True","None","False","True","2316","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Crownview Drive","","2978","","","Ranch","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","6707","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Underground Utilities, Water Connected","Bridge(s), City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic, Vincent Thomas Bridge, Water","True","https://tour.caimagemaker.com/l/?id=181393IDX","","Double Pane Windows, Drapes","1960","90275","",""
