l appliances including a 6 burner plus griddle stove top with industrial hood. Custom cabinets with stone counters with frig, dishwasher, oven and microwave make your next meal a breeze. The marble center Island with farmhouse sink affords a ton of work space and extra casual setting. The kitchen opens to a huge open space which enjoys a dining area and family room. Glass doors open to a large patio perfect for al fresco dining and surrounded by lush landscaping positioned to take in all the amazing views. The master bedroom suite opens to amazing views of the lush landscaping and covered patio. Rejuvenate in the new master bathroom with stone shower and jetted soaking tub. Additional features include A/C, whole house fan, new doors and windows, ceiling fans, and mature fruit trees. Residents have access to the top-ranked Palos Verdes Schools such as Mira Catalina Elementary, Miraleste Intermediate, and your choice from two of the top ranked high schools in California. Minutes away, you can enjoy a game of golf or dine at Terranea Resort. Or take a stroll through one of the many hiking trails, either way you are surrounded by the best of California coastal living.","Composition","Foyer, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Palos Verdes","Miraleste","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","LOCK BOX TO BE INSTALLED SAT mAY 31ST","","","","","2667","Seller","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Kingsridge","","30229","Drive","","Contemporary","Contract","","15809","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Harbor, Hills, Mountain(s), Neighborhood","True","","","Double Pane Windows","1960","90275","6431","RPRS13000*"
