 Door","True","Patio, Front Porch","True","41","","None","False","Negotiable","773.2","Perched at the top of a serene cul-de-sac in prestigious Miraleste Hills, this majestic 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom residence captures sweeping ocean and harbor views from almost every room in the house. Surrounded by mature trees and lush landscaping, the home offers a rare sense of privacy and seclusion and is over 5 miles away from the landslide zone. Inside, a spacious and elegant living room sets the tone for the rest of the home, flowing effortlessly into a formal dining room?perfect for hosting family and friends. The bright, open-concept kitchen is a chef?s dream, appointed with rich cabinetry, gleaming granite countertops, and stainless steel appliances. Just off the kitchen, the inviting family room features a cozy fireplace and built-in wet bar?an ideal setting for entertaining or relaxing evenings at home. A stylish powder room completes the main level, while upstairs you'll find four generously sized bedrooms and two well-appointed bathrooms. The expansive primary suite offers a walk-in closet with custom built-ins, an ensuite bath with a soaking tub and separate walk-in shower and an opportunity to soak in fresh ocean breezes and stunning vistas from your balcony. Comfort is ensured year-round with central air conditioning, and practical amenities include a full laundry room, attached two-car garage with storage, and ample additional parking. Designed for seamless indoor-outdoor living, the home features patios off both the kitchen and family room?ideal for al fresco dining or enjoying peaceful evenings under the stars. The beautifully manicured front lawn invites you to relax with a glass of wine while taking in the panoramic coastal scenery. This is Southern California living at its finest?peaceful, private, and just moments from top-rated schools, shopping, dining, and coastal attractions. With no power lines blocking your view and the fire department just minutes away 