xury of resort-style living. Custom double entry doors open to rustic hardwood floors and period perfect custom tiles. A wall of glass is positioned to bring the outdoor elements right into your living space. This sense of mastery continues into the gourmet kitchen equipped with dream appliances to meet every culinary need. Professional grade appliances are surrounded by custom cabinets with soft auto-closing doors and drawers. Quartz counters and backsplash molded around a stainless steel sink creates the ultimate first impression. From cool ocean breezes to distressed hardwood floors, this home sings with the brightest notes of nature. The living room is anchored by an elevated fireplace that opens to a fabulous dining room all positioned to take in the amazing views. The master suite has vaulted ceilings, a private balcony with views of the ocean and an additional balcony with direct access to an in-ground heated spa. The master bath enjoys double sinks and a separate tub and shower. The family room opens to a balcony that affords panoramic views of the harbor and city. Directly off the family room is a covered patio and exterior dining area that is surrounded by lush landscaping. The rear grounds with mature trees and large grass area have direct access to the city maintained trails that stretch miles thru the peninsula. Minutes from this secluded hideaway, you can enjoy a world class dining experience at Terranea Resort or take a stroll through the nature preserve. In this prime Palos Verdes location, you are surrounded by the best of California coastal living.","Tile","Den, Entry, Foyer, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Palos Verdes","Miraleste","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","First showing to be Sunday from 1-4 during the open house  Appointment only after the open house  Text for all showings 310-480-3601","","","