ched elegantly on the east slope of Rancho Palos Verdes, this mid-century modern masterpiece boasts awe-inspiring panoramic vistas of the city skyline, the vast expanse of the ocean, the majestic mountains, the bustling harbor, and the breathtaking coastline. The sleek lines of the architecture seamlessly blend with the natural surroundings, creating a harmonious oasis of luxury and tranquility. Step inside to discover radiant heated floors, a spacious interior flooded with natural light, featuring minimalist design elements, high ceilings, and floor-to-ceiling windows framing the picturesque views. Adjacent to the main residence, a chic guest annex beckons with an extra bedroom and bathroom, offering unparalleled comfort and privacy for visitors. This extraordinary home epitomizes sophistication and refinement, a sanctuary where 60's modern living meets unparalleled natural beauty. Every corner of this cherished home tells a story of a family's love and dedication over six decades. From the carefully preserved architectural details to the bespoke fixtures that showcase a unique blend of style and functionality, this residence is a living testament to the art of creating a home that transcends generations. As you walk through the rooms, you can feel the echoes of laughter, shared meals, and cherished memories that have shaped this space into more than just a house?it is a living, breathing time capsule of a life well-lived.","","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Foyer, Galley Kitchen, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Dapplegray","Palos Verdes","Miraleste","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Call or better, text Charlie to show. Easy access.  310.377.4932 Agent notes..The ""annex"" is a separate bedroom and bath found outside the kitchen door to the right. Same key as the front door.  Also- There was a leak in the pool so seller emptied it about a year ago.  Please be careful in that area.","True","None","False","True","2417","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Chandeleur","","2072","Drive","","Mid Century Modern","Cash to New Loan","","21143","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Bay, City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Hills, Marina, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic, Vincent Thomas Bridge, Water","True","","","","1960","90275","6330","RPRS20000*"
"","0.3744","","6 Burner Stove, Dishwasher","True","167 - PV Dr East","Unknown","True","7557007021","","0","","False","3","","","2","1","4","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","","","","","Wall/Window Unit(s), Zoned","True","Los Angeles","21","2400000","#ERR","09/10/2025 3:34:17 PM","","","10/01/2025 12:00:00 AM","11/06/2025 11:09:19 AM","11/27/2025 12:00:00 AM","","09/10/2025 12:00:00 AM","10/01/2025 12:00:00 AM","09/28/2025 5:33:13 PM","","11/06/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","21","","False","","","","","","","","Bonus Room, Kitchen, Living Room","True","Stone","True","","","","True","True","On waterpipe next to water hose","Supra","False","","","","33.751648","Dryer Included, Individual Room, Inside, Washer Included","True","False","","","2400000","","","2400000","#ERR","","","daniel@liveinla.net","","Daniel","","","Assayag","","sbassadan","","","","","sb1303660","310-265-8889","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-541-8271","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.323456","","7114","16309","0-1 Unit/Acre, Back Yard","Hiking ","","Assessor","","","SB25213251","","2","7","","1","Owner","","","","","Driveway Down Slope From Street, Garage","True","","","40","","None","False","","840.34","An extraordinary opportunity to own a true piece of architectural and artistic history in Rancho Palos Verdes. Designed by renowned architect Walter Davis?best known for the iconic La Venta Inn?this custom 4-bedroom + bonus room, 3-bath residence was originally built for his son and today is home to celebrated Palos Verdes artist Adolfo Girala. A rare combination of architectural pedigree and artistic legacy, this property is truly one-of-a-kind. Set on a generous 16,293 sq ft lot, the 2,856 sq ft home captures breathtaking views of the San Pedro and Long Beach harbors, offering ever-changing scenery from dawn to sparkling city lights. From the moment you arrive, a tranquil koi pond and fountain welcome you, setting the stage for the home?s unique blend of serenity and artistry. Inside, craftsmanship and history come alive. There are three fireplaces, including a remarkable centerpiece in the kitchen, hand-carved in Venice, Italy. The living room and additional spaces feature Venetian plaster walls, adding depth and character throughout. In 2014, the home underwent an extensive renovation, including the kitchen, bathrooms, and living areas. Original mosaics?pieces of art in their own right?were carefully preserved and seamlessly integrated into the remodel, ensuring that history and modern design live side by side. Other highlights include a temperature-controlled built-in wine cellar, three wall-mounted HVAC zones, and generous natural light in nearly every room. The backyard is a private retreat with mature tangerine, orange, avocado, and fig trees, creating a lush orchard-like setting. Combined with harbor views, the outdoor space is ideal for quiet mornings, entertaining, or simply enjoying the beauty of the Peninsula. This is far more than just a residence?it?s a living masterpiece, created by a renowned architect, preserved and enhanced by a renowned artist, and offered now as a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to own a home that is itself a work of art.","","Art Studio, Bonus Room, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Owner occupied. EZ to show. Call/text Daniel 310-493-2100","True","","","","2856","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Three Or More ","","","Via Canada","","6252","","","Mediterranean, Spanish","Cash to New Loan","","8471","","Single Family Residence","","","Bridge(s), Harbor, Ocean","True","","","","1960","90275","",""
