r Freeway. Newly remodeled Spanish paradise with custom stone balusters. Great curb appeal. New brick paver driveway W/ room for 4 cars. Huge front brick paver courtyard with fountain. Multiple decks and courtyards. Fully fenced and security gated. Custom Spanish tile porch + iron railings, scrolled iron entry door w/ glass panels. 3 living/family rooms, vaulted, coffered ceilings and new stone fireplace. Wide plank flooring throughout, crystal chandeliers throughout. BRAND NEW KITCHEN AND STAINLESS APPLIANCES, garden window, eat in kitchen, huge wrap around Trex deck off main living room. Upstairs: Find amazing primary suite with sitting area, ocean/harbor view, 2 his/hers closets, custom organizers, remodeled bath with double sinks, oodles of storage. Across the hall find children's wing with 2nd family/study/play room, three additional bedrooms. Downstairs: find huge 3rd family/media room, wet bar and potential ADU with 2nd kitchen, Mother In Law's/guest quarters/5th bedroom zero steps to enter. Laundry room and an additional pool room/sunroom/cabana/atrium Outside: Hundreds of thousands of dollars spent on exterior remodel/yard/pool.....Multiple brick paver patios, walkways and decks. Multiple fountains front and back. Post lights/lanterns on timers surround property... Pool is fully remodeled, rebuilt, retiled and re plastered, new pool equipment on remote. new bbq island and gas fire pit. ORCHARD of citrus, fig, Japanese kumquat, pomegranate, lemon, orange, and avocado trees, elevated gardening beds with organic kale and Swiss chard. Oversized 3 car garage with custom floor coating. new garage doors, new rain gutters, new stucco, new paint, new Ring 8 camera security system. New interior doors, new barn doors, brand new air ducting, high efficiency heater.","Spanish Tile","Atrium, Attic, Bonus Room, Dance Studio, Den, Dressing Area, Entry, Exercise Room, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Game Room, Great Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Laund