"","0.4713","The motor for the front gate is inoperable and the seller will not repair it. The 5 light fixtures on the front of the house are decorative and non-functioning. Miraleste Hills has a voluntary Community Association with annual dues of $150.00 The photos of the fireplace with flames is for marketing purposes only and it does not imply they are operable. The square footage of the house varies from various sources: The buyer to confirm. County tax assessor at 4776; appraisal report at 4123, building plans per seller at 4447. Buyer to verify square footage (lot and structure) and all MLS information. Broker and Agent do not guarantee the accuracy of square footage, bedroom and bathroom count, lot size, ordinances, zoning, rent control, permits, use code, schools, and/or other information concerning the conditions or features of the property provided by the seller, obtained from public records or all other sources.","6 Burner Stove, Dishwasher, Double Oven, Electric Oven, Gas Cooktop, Gas Water Heater, Indoor Grill, Ice Maker, Instant Hot Water, Microwave","True","167 - PV Dr East","Unknown","True","7566011019","","0","","False","5","1","","","4","4","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Text Message","","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","164","2725000","#ERR","02/23/2024 10:31:40 AM","","","03/16/2024 12:00:00 AM","04/12/2024 6:36:49 PM","04/20/2024 12:00:00 AM","","02/23/2024 12:00:00 AM","","04/10/2024 11:10:08 AM","","04/12/2024 12:00:00 AM","","","17","Double Door Entry","True","Breakfast Nook, Dining Room, In Kitchen","","Stucco","","","","","Family Room, Living Room","True","Carpet, Wood","True","Central, Forced Air","True","Balcony, Granite Counters, Tile Counters","True","True","Front Door","Supra","False","","","","33.748071","Individual Room, Inside, Washer Hookup","True","True","","Easements","2725000","","","2725000","#ERR","310-427-3369","","atodora1@yahoo.com","310-349-3128","Anthony","","","Todora","","VTODOANT","","","","","V7044","310-831-1684","RE/MAX Estate Properties","310-831-0222","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.328901","","32","20528","0-1 Unit/Acre, Back Yard, Landscaped","Gutters","","Assessor","","","PV24037544","","3","3","","1","Owner","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Concrete, Garage, Garage - Three Door","True","Patio, Patio Open, Porch, Front Porch, Rear Porch","True","17","","Private, In Ground","True","Close Plus, Negotiable","660.93","Standing proud on an impressive 20,000 sqft lot in the beautiful Miraleste Hills neighborhood, this incredible Rancho Palos Verdes view residence is one you?ll be proud to call your own! A paved driveway bordered by lush foliage leads to this spectacular home, offering 4 bedrooms, 4.5 baths, & multiple indoor & outdoor entertainment areas. Through the double-door entry, discover a stunning two-story foyer finished in rich textured tiles & anchored by a sweeping staircase with a stunning wood railing. Across the approx. 4,123 sqft layout, stylish wallpaper & detailed crown molding combine to create an atmosphere of pure sophistication. Expansive glass sliders throughout frame awe-inspiring coastline vistas at every turn, from the carpeted living room kept warm by an impressive fireplace to the formal dining area basking under the elegant chandelier. Enhanced by majestic shoreline scenery from every window, the updated eat-in kitchen is a chef?s dream, sporting a complement of stainless steel appliances, including a 48? 6-burner range with a griddle & double ovens. Cabinetry with trim lighting, chic backsplash, a generous walk-in pantry, & sleek granite countertops that extend to the pendant-lit island complete this impeccable culinary masterpiece. Savor morning coffee as you take in the fantastic cityscape from the breakfast nook, or lose yourself in a good book by the stone fireplace in the family room while appreciating striking ocean and mountain panorama views. Indulge in amazing views of the harbor from any of the four well-proportioned upper-level private bedrooms, two of which feature en suites and are located in opposite wings. Your primary suite enjoys an oversized boutique-like closet & a luxurious 5-piece ensuite with dual vanities, a separate shower, and a spa-like soaking tub. Additional perks are a well-sized laundry room with plenty of storage & an attached 3-car drive-through garage. Unarguably the best spot to hang out & unwind, your outdoor oasis with outstanding views lets you enjoy the ultimate Southern California lifestyle amid a remarkable backdrop like no other. Share afternoon drinks or nightcaps on the pergola-covered patio, made even more enchanting by the meticulously maintained & well-lit garden. Host weekend BBQs in the backyard as guests relax by the large 9-jet spa, ideal for a floating cocktail hour. A fabulous location means you?ll have close proximity to shopping, dining, the beach, leisurely activities, & major freeways.","Spanish Tile","All Bedrooms Up, Attic, Center Hall, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Two Primaries, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palo Verde Unified","","","","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Easy to Show with confirmed appointment. Please text your contact information with showing date and time to LA. 310.738.6775 AND a CBS code will be sent upon confirmation of appointment. Please do not use showing time for appointments. Thank you for showing.","True","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","","4123","Appraiser","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Grandpoint Lane","","29711","","","Contemporary","Cash to New Loan","","7090","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Available, Natural Gas Connected","Bay, Bridge(s), City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic, Vincent Thomas Bridge, Wate