c curtains, perfect for indoor/outdoor living. Formal dining that shares the panoramic views of the great room with built in custom cabinetry, recessed lighting & folding sliders connect into the kitchen for ease of entertaining & the outdoors for extended entertaining. There are 2 separate bedroom wings, a primary ensuite w/ Harbor views, fireplace, wood-wrapped beams ensuite bath w/marble tub, quartz countertop slabs, electric skylight & custom walk-in closet/dressing room worth of a celebrity. Bedroom wing 2 with 4 bedrooms (options for an office or workout room) two full baths & powder room in button tile black & silver. A separate laundry room w/ 2 sets of stackable washer/dryers by Samsung & sink. Separated from the main house is an ADU undergoing the permitting process includes a bedroom, kitchen, dining area, closet, & mini-split perfect for multi-generational living/guest quarters/office/rental. Garage parking for 2 & 4 additional dedicated parking spaces in the drive, 2 electric charging stations. The back yard entertaining space has professional plans done & approved by the city for a luxurious swimming pool that will be provided to the buyer. With over an 1/2 acre the sky is the limit for back-yard entertaining. Information deemed reliable but not guaranteed. Broker/brokers agents do not represent or guarantee accuracy of info, or permitting, buyer responsible/verification. Photos/videos coming.","","All Bedrooms Down, Center Hall, Dressing Area, Entry, Formal Entry, Foyer, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Seller request POF/Preapproval prior to tour for total amount of sale, emailed to the listing agent. No exceptions. Listing agent must have 24 - 48 hours' notice to book a tour. Thank You for consideration of tour. Charles.provenzano@vistasir.com","","None","Fal