LOS VERDES, THIS CUSTOM MEDITERRANEAN ESTATE, FEATURES EXPANSIVE VIEW FROM OCEAN, HARBOR, CITY TO MOUNTAIN VIEW.  THIS CLASSIC MASTERPIECE HAS BEEN METICULOUSLY DESIGNED WITH SOPHISTICATIONS AND TIMELESS BEAUTY IN STRIKING BLEND OF CYLINDERS, PARABOLAS, COLUMNS, WRAPPED IN RICH AGED-TERRA-CONCRETE EXTERIOR, CREATING A RARE ARCHITECTURAL PIECE; THIS BEAUTIFUL ESTATE BOASTS OVER 5400 SF OF LUXURY LIVING, DUAL LEVELS, WITH 5 SPACIOUS ENSUITE, 5 BATHS, WINE CELLAR, TO BE SCREEN ROOM, UTILITIES ROOMS, DUAL LEVEL LAUNDRY FACILITIES. A PRIVATE DRIVEWAY LEADS YOU TO A CIRCULAR MOTOR COURT WITH TWIN TWO-CAR GARAGES  AMIABLE PARKING FOR HALF OF DOZEN OF LUXURY CARS; YOU WILL BE GREETED WITH GRAND-ARCH DOUBLE-DOOR ENTRY THAT OPENS TO A LIVING SPACE WHICH IS INVITING AND ATTENTION TO DETAIL THROUGHOUT - MARBLE FLOORS GUIDE YOU PAST A CUSTOM MOSAIC TO FLOOR-TO-CEILING WINDOWS THAT FRAME THE BREATH-TAKEN VIEW OF THE 180 DEGREE PANORAMIC OCEAN & HARBOR VIEWS, HIGH CATHEDRAL CEILINGS, SKYLIGHTS, 3 ELEGANT FIREPLACES, EUROPEAN BUILT-IN CABINETS OFFERING BOTH FUNCTIONALITY AND STYLE. THE WELCOMING FOYER LEADS TO THE LIVING ROOM THAT BOASTS AN AWE-INSPIRING GLASS-WALLED & INVITING LARGE OUTDOOR PATIO THAT CAPTIVATES THE EVER-CHANGING VISTAS. THE INTERIOR IS EQUALLY IMPRESSIVE, COMBINING LIGHT CHERRY RED OAK FLOORS, HIGH CEILINGS, SKYLIGHTS WITH CASCADING LIGHT, WALLS OF PICTURESQUE GLASS ; MEANWHILE, THE FAMILY ROOM SHOWCASES AN ASTOUNDING FIREPLACE WITH AN EXOTIC MANTLE. THE EUROPEAN-STYLE KITCHEN IS A CHEF'S DREAM, OUTFITTED WITH RARE MARBLE COUNTERTOPS, EXCEPTIONALLY DESIGN CABINETRY THRU-OUT, HIGH-END WOLF/MIELE APPLIANCES AND A SPACIOUS WALK-IN PANTRY CAPABLE TO SERVE ANY SPECIAL FAMILY EVENTS. THE LUXURIOUS CUSTOM & BUILT-IN CABINETS EXTEND TO THE FORMAL DINING ROOM AND TO THE LOWER LEVEL. THE PRIMARY MASTER SUITE IS TO DIE-FOR, GRACIOUS FRENCH-DOORS & WALL-TO-CEILING GLASS WINDOWS CAPTURE THE INTOXICATING OCEAN & HARBOR VIEW, PRIVATE TERRACE, SEPARATE LIBRARY/OFFICE, DECADENT BATHROOM SPA WITH JETTED TUB AND 7-HEAD WALK-IN SHOWER,  SPACIOUS WALK-IN CLOSET, OFFERING A TRUE RETREAT WITHIN THE HOME.   THIS PROMINENT ESTATE SITUATES ON AN EXPANSIVE .35-ACRE LOT INVITES RELAXATION IN ITS SERENE ROSE & FRUIT TREE GARDEN, WITH AMPLE SPACE FOR A FUTURE POOL SHOULD YOU DESIRE.   THIS ESTATE HAS IT ALL !!!  MINS  FROM TRUMP NATIONAL GOLF COURSE, ABALONE COVE, CATALINA ISLAND TO THE LUXURIOUS TERRANEA RESORT AND PT. VICENTE LIGHTHOUSE.  THIS ONE-OF-A-KIND ESTATE IS A RARE GEM, COMBINING ARCHITECTURAL BRILLIANCE WITH UNPARALLELED COMFORT AND BREATHTAKING VIEWS.  DON'T MISS THE OPPORTUNITYCALL ME SO WE MAKE THIS YOUR NEXT DREAM HOME !!","","Entry, Family Room, Library, Living Room, Office, Projection, Retreat, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: PLS CALL LISTING BROKER: CHARLES H. LE 310-622-3663, 310-990-3864 Showing Information: Appointment w/List. Office,Call LA 1,Appointment Only,Listing Agent Accompanies ","True","None","False","","5467","","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Via Colinita","","6337","","","Mediterranean","Trust Deed","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Bay, City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Ocean, Trees/Woods","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=gK5JBndeza7&mls=1","","Drapes","2005","90275","6455","RPRS13000*"
