n and Catalina views, opens to the outdoor patio, bringing the outdoors in. Ascend to the second story and you'll find five bedrooms (one bedroom serves as an upstairs study and used to access two bedrooms), including a generous master suite with it's own outlook onto the ocean. Stay comfortable year-round with central heat and ocean breezes. The backyard is a tranquil oasis with its lush landscaping, perfect for year-round entertaining, surrounded by mature trees and vegetation.  The two 2-car garage offers plenty of storage and also opens to the rear yard.  This amazing home offers it all, with plenty of space and amazing views. As an added bonus, the house has been loved and cherished by the original owner since its construction. Close to shopping, restaurants and the new UCLA campus.  Don't miss this rare opportunity to enjoy the best of the California Coastal living from 30802 Ganado Drive!","","Family Room, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","","","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","No lockbox, call listing agent to schedule, open house this weekend.","","None","False","","2520","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two, Multi/Split ","","","Ganado","","30802","Drive","","","Conventional","","27611","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon, Catalina, Coastline, Ocean","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=VPfvBBwp7DW&brand=0","","","1965","90275","6242","RPRS13000*"
