 The gourmet kitchen is engulfed in designer quartzite stone counters and enjoys new modern all wood cabinets with soft-close doors and drawers. A Sub-Zero and new double ovens and new stove top creates the ultimate cooking venue that any chef would appreciate. Double dishwashers and multiple custom pull outs complete the culinary experience. The master suite opens to jaw dropping ocean and city views and enjoys a sitting room, fireplace, wet bar, and three closets.  The master bath with double-sink counters includes separate Jacuzzi tub and steam shower. A family room with fireplace is the perfect spot for nice gatherings. Rear yard enjoys stone flooring and covered patio all opening up to the amazing views of the Pacific Ocean. Additional features include new Anderson doors and windows, new balcony, new PEX plumbing lines, new heater and exterior landscaping. Located on a quiet street with only one neighbor on one side. Easy freeway access for downtown LA commutes and Top Ranked Palos Verdes Schools. Less than 10 minutes to freeway access, Terranea Resort and Trump National Golf Course. The owner is also open to selling all the furniture and art work.","Tile","Entry, Foyer, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Two Primaries","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Palos Verdes","Miraleste","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","PLEASE DO NOT CONTACT THE SELLER WE ARE TAKING IT OFF THE MARKET FOR NOW.  ANY INTEREST CALL JERRY YUTRONICH AT 310-480-3601","","","","","4001","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Paseo De Castana","","20","","","Mediterranean","Contract","","33206","","Single Family Residence","","","Bridge(s), City Lights, Harbor, Hills, Marina, Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic, Vincent Thomas Bridge","True","https://www.zillow.com/view-3d-home/28a17cdb-2eed-44f4-8d1b-015ce32d600f?setAttribution=mls&wl=true","https://www.zillow.com/view-3d-home/28a17cdb-2eed-44f4-8d1b-015ce32d600f?s