"","0.221","Bret Lewis, 480-225-6616, bretrealty@gmail.com","6 Burner Stove, Dishwasher, Electric Oven, Freezer, Disposal, Gas Range, Microwave, Tankless Water Heater","True","168 - Mira Catalina","Unknown","True","7558014031","","0","","False","4","","","","4","3","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","Agent Text Message","Agent Fax","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","27","2799000","#ERR","11/07/2024 8:57:36 AM","","","12/19/2024 12:00:00 AM","12/19/2024 4:33:08 PM","","","11/06/2024 12:00:00 AM","","11/22/2024 9:30:45 AM","","12/19/2024 12:00:00 AM","","","27","","False","Area","","","","","","","Family Room","True","","True","Central","True","Recessed Lighting","True","True","Front Door when ACTIVE","Supra","False","","","","33.735211","Gas Dryer Hookup","True","False","","","2799000","","","2799000","#ERR","","","BretRealty@gmail.com","866-806-8760","Bret","","0","Lewis","","PLEWIBRE","","0","480-225-6616","0","PB16384","866-806-8760","Bret Lewis, Broker","562-726-2515","0","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.338852","","143","9628","Sprinkler System, Yard","Biking , Curbs, Hiking , Sidewalks, Street Lights, Suburban","","Assessor","","","PW24229319","","3","5","","3","Owner","","","","","Garage Faces Front","True","","","60","","None","False","","1106.32","Experience luxury coastal living in this stunningly remodeled home, nestled in the highly sought-after Mira Catalina neighborhood of Rancho Palos Verdes. Offering breathtaking views of Catalina Island and the ocean from every bedroom, this property seamlessly blends sophisticated design with modern functionality to create a home that is both elegant and inviting. Every detail has been thoughtfully curated to enhance style and comfort, making this a truly exceptional retreat. This home features three spacious bedrooms, four exquisitely designed bathrooms, and a versatile den. Two primary suites?one on the main level and another upstairs?offer ultimate flexibility and privacy, each complete with walk-in closets and spa-inspired en-suite bathrooms. The bathrooms are designed with luxurious touches, including a standalone tub featured in one primary en-suite, dual sinks, and Brizo Champagne Bronze finishes, elevating everyday living to a new level of refinement. The heart of the home is a chef's dream kitchen, equipped with brand-new Signature Kitchen Suite appliances, custom Rift White Oak cabinetry, and stunning MSI Calcatta Abezzo quartz countertops. Thoughtful details like Top Knob modern cabinet pulls and new designer lighting?including kitchen pendants, chandeliers, and sconces?add to the space?s timeless appeal. A newly tiled fireplace in the living area enhances the warmth and style of the home, while Vandyck engineered wood floors and recessed lighting flow seamlessly throughout. New vinyl windows frame the captivating views, while a striking 10-foot custom front door sets the tone for the modern sophistication within. The fully finished garage, complete with an epoxy flake system floor and brand-new garage doors, ensures both practicality and style. Outside, the home boasts smooth stucco exteriors, carefully landscaped front and backyards, and newly poured concrete areas. The backyard is a true haven, featuring custom cable railings, Mangaris decks, and ample space to relax and enjoy the ocean breeze. From the custom Deus modern mailbox to the stylish exterior light fixtures, no detail has been overlooked. Whether entertaining guests or enjoying peaceful moments, this home offers the perfect balance of luxury, comfort, and stunning coastal views, making it a rare and extraordinary find in one of Southern California?s most desirable neighborhoods.","","Den, Family Room, Great Room, Kitchen, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Vacant, Supra, Go Dire