urts, a pool, spa, and clubhouse, all within walking distance to the ocean.This beautifully upgraded end-unit home features a fully remodeled kitchen with custom cabinetry, new countertops, upgraded appliances, and a spacious island that opens to the living room. The inviting living area offers a fireplace, bar/coffee nook, and direct access to a private patio. Upstairs, the primary suite showcases ocean, Catalina, and sunset views from a private balcony, a second fireplace, a walk-in closet, and a luxurious spa-inspired bath with dual sinks, jetted tub, and separate shower. The secondary bathroom has also been tastefully remodeled. Additional upgrades include new energy-efficient windows and sliding doors, recessed LED lighting, fresh interior paint, smart climate control with Wi-Fi thermostat, Ring security system, new electrical panel ready for EV charging upgrades, and a quiet-drive garage door. Prime location near scenic hiking trails leading to Terranea Resort and the Golden Cove Center with Trader Joe?s, Starbucks, and dining options. Situated within the award-winning Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District, one of the top districts in California. Move-in ready coastal living at its finest! Schedule a private tour today and make this exceptional home yours!","","Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Multi-Level Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","NO SHOWINGTIME!  The property is vacant. Please call or text prior to showing. Kindly wear shoe covers while touring the home. Supra lockbox is located at the front gate.","","","","","2040","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Coastsite","","32541","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","33358","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=2j9KTuuJNPP","","","1979","90275","5889","RPRS10000*"
