s, are also within walking distance, offering ample recreational opportunities. This 3-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom home boasts peek-a-boo ocean views from the primary suite. Sunlight streams into every room, creating a sense of spaciousness and warmth. The well-thought-out floor plan features a light-filled living room with a cozy fireplace, dining room, an inviting kitchen, and a welcoming great room.  The beautifully landscaped front yard welcomes you home with lush greenery and vibrant flowers. Retreat to your primary bedroom with large floor-to-ceiling windows with garden views that provide an abundance of natural light. All bedrooms are thoughtfully located down the hallway from the entry, ensuring privacy. The spacious great room, perfectly combines with the kitchen, featuring a wall of sliding doors that open to an expansive landscaped backyard, patio, and pool. Adjacent to the kitchen, you'll find a laundry area, a stylish half bath, and direct access to the 2-car garage.  The backyard is a true haven, with stunning landscaping that includes mature fruit trees, a producing avocado tree, and a seating area perfect for relaxation. Discover a nature lover's dream yard with a pool that beckons you to unwind and enjoy quiet evenings under the stars. The backyard is also an ideal space for friends and family gatherings, providing endless fun and cherished memories.","","Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Palos Verdes","Miralest","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Private Showings Contact Listing Agent: Joseph Nwabuzor (310) 989-0997  joseph@haynesre.com","","","","True","1834","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Stalwart","","4217","Drive","","","Contract","","22835","","Single Family Residence","","","Peek-A-Boo","True","","","","1960","90275","6024","RPRS13000*"
