ill, and exquisite Paradiso Granite counters with Braun steel soft-close drawers. Solid maple cabinetry adds warmth, complemented by 8? x 8? Spanish tile flooring in the kitchen and hallway. Designed for seamless indoor-outdoor living, the estate offers expansive decks crafted from premium wood, free of knots, creating a tranquil retreat in nature. The Japanese-inspired steam shower features etched Reed pattern glass doors, black walnut-framed cabinets, and teakwood doors, elevating the spa-like experience. Rich in history, this estate was once the heart of Vanderlip Estate gatherings in the 1930s, hosting Hollywood legends like Clark Gable. The grounds include one of the world?s largest olive trees, with a 60-foot spread, famously used in Vanderlip?s Christmas photos. Modern luxuries include German-engineered Grohe fixtures, a tankless water heater with a circulating pump, and an on-site propane tank. This extraordinary estate is a true paradise, where timeless architecture meets natural beauty.","","Laundry, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Call for appointment with a few hours notice- you will need the gate code and directions","False","None","False","","2207","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Cinnamon","","7","Lane","","Craftsman","Cash To Existing Loan","","14195","","Single Family Residence","","Sewer Connected","Ocean, Trees/Woods","True","","","","1950","90275","5902","RPRS20000&E*"
