"716.4","Located just a half mile from the renowned four-star Terranea Resort, this recently upgraded corner property features four bedrooms, 3.5 baths, and approximately 3,036 sq. ft. of living space. This home designed for both comfort and luxury. Enjoy stunning ocean and Catalina Island views from the front balcony, living room, dining room, and kitchen. The entryway welcomes guests with soaring high ceilings, an abundance of natural light, and stylish stained-glass accents, creating an impressive first impression. The upper level features a living room with a fireplace and access to a newly refinished balcony with waterproof paint. Adjacent is the formal dining room and a convenient powder room for guests. The Jr. primary suite includes a walk-in closet and serene greenbelt views. Its beautifully remodeled bathroom boasts double sinks, a separate shower, and a large jetted tub. The kitchen is a chef?s dream. Recently remodeled, the gourmet kitchen showcases brand-new slate-colored appliances, including a refrigerator, oven, microwave, dishwasher, and a wine refrigerator. It also features a built-in five-burner cooktop, a massive center island with elegant granite ountertops, and a light-filled breakfast area (could be a family room) that opens to a cozy sitting space with access to a rear deck which is uniquely built out approx. 225 sqft off the combined kitchen/family room work space, with a special garden below and finished outdoor room with bar, sink, TV, refrigerator and fire pit. The lower level includes a primary suite with a walk-in closet and a remodeled bathroom featuring double sinks and an oversized shower. Two additional guest bedrooms share beautifully remodeled bathroom. A laundry room in the hallway adds convenience, and both the primary suite and one guest bedroom have direct access to the lush backyard and patio area. The tranquil outdoor space features a soothing water fountain and professional landscaping in both the front and rear yards. Additional features include an attached two-car garage, updated electrical and air conditioning systems. Community features: merely steps away to just completed new quartz pool and spa, a gorgeous remodeled and furnished club house with large screen TV and kitchen, tennis and pickle ball courts, BBQ and gym all available exclusively to Sea Bluff owners and their guests.","","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Price reduction! Seller is very motivated.  Please contact listing agent, 310-383-0469 with 24hr notice due to a little dog. Thank you","","","","True","3036","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Sandy Point","","6521","Court","","Mediterranean","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","35040","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","Plantation Shutters","1987","90275","5871","RPRS10000*"
