Ground, Lap","True","Close Plus 3 Days, See Remarks","1105.73","Welcome to your dream home in the highly sought-after community of  Ladera Linda. Situated on the view side of Vigilance Dr, this stunning residence boasts 4 beds, 3 baths and is the perfect blend of comfort, style, and an outdoor paradise with breathtaking ocean and Catalina Island views, making it the ideal sanctuary! Ladera Linda is south facing, offering the best weather on the hill, and has underground utilities. The large formal entry with clear views of the ocean welcomes you to this retreat. The open-floor plan features a central staircase and provides a comfortable flow to each room. The large kitchen with living and eating area has a Jade 6 burner gas range with convection oven, custom hickory wood peninsula and a slider to the lush side patio. The living and dining areas with huge ocean views offer a gas fireplace for cooler evenings. The spacious 1st floor primary suite is a true retreat, offering breathtaking ocean and coastline views. It features a large open dressing area with built-in closets and plenty of shelving, a remodeled primary bath with tile flooring and oversized shower with bench, rainfall showerhead and separate handheld. Bask in the sunshine and enjoy Catalina views while lying in bed or transform your day through the slider to the outdoor patio. The backyard resort-style living provides your own lap pool and spa, flagstone paths through natural grass and a redwood deck with sprawling views of Catalina, Terranea and the coast. Driveway pavers, wrought iron fencing, and Anderson Windows and doors add to the exterior's charm. There is so much more to see! Located in the award-winning Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District, this home is close to Golden Cove shopping and restaurants, Terranea Resort, Trump National Golf Course, and hiking trails. Experience coastal living at its finest. Don?t miss this rare opportunity to own a slice of paradise!","Metal","Den, Formal En