"","1.7329","Sadly this used to be very special and beautiful paradise, land movement is now visible...... Can it be saved??","","","169 - PV Dr South","Special Assessments","True","7572016027","Horse Trails","110","","False","5","1","","3","1","3","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Text Message","","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","44","4000000","#ERR","06/21/2024 3:14:02 PM","","","08/04/2024 12:00:00 AM","08/04/2024 7:12:01 PM","","","06/20/2024 12:00:00 AM","","06/25/2024 3:37:16 PM","","08/04/2024 12:00:00 AM","","Southwest","44","Double Door Entry, French Doors","True","","","","","","","","Family Room, Patio, Great Room","True","Wood","True","Central","True","Bar, Beamed Ceilings, Cathedral Ceiling(s), Granite Counters, Pantry, Stone Counters","True","True","see remarks","None","False","","","","33.745121","In Garage","True","False","","","4000000","","","4000000","#ERR","310-721-3196","","lida.sandera@vistasir.com","310-545-0515","Lida","310-545-5508","","Sandera","","ssandlid","","","3105467622","338","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.372094","","51","75484","Back Yard, Cul-De-Sac, Front Yard, Lot Over 40000 Sqft, Irregular Lot, Value In Land, Yard","Hiking , Horse Trails, Stable(s)","Gated Community","Assessor","","","SB24127498","","2","2","","1","Vacant","","","","Guest House","Driveway, Driveway Down Slope From Street, Garage, Garage - Two Door","True","Patio, Patio Open, Stone","True","65","","Private, Indoor","True","","1225.11","Located in the equestrian gated community of Portuguese Bend, Rancho Palos Verdes, Thyme Place is a small cul-de-sac street with only five homes. This spectacular property features two separate parcels totaling over 1.7 acres and offers expansive, unobstructed views of the blue Pacific Ocean, Catalina Island, and city lights. You can enjoy watching whales migrating to Mexico and later returning to Alaska, playful dolphins, sailboats, or even peacocks parading right in front of you! The Portuguese Riding Club, Terranea Resort, Abalone Club, and Trump National Golf Course are all nearby. In 2004, architect Edward Carson Beall, a natural history buff and collector of fossils and antiques, designed a Tuscan-style farmhouse on this land with pool and guest house.This unusual and very special property has changed hands a few times since then. The last owner purchased the home over a year ago, planning to move in after retirement from the Northeast Coast. Unfortunately, business commitments have prevented her from ever moving here.  After this year's unusual rains and storms, the Portuguese Bend soil has become even more unstable. Therefore, the house is now offered primarily for its land value. It's up to the buyer to decide if it's possible to save this special house. Perhaps it can be a magical place again...","Slate","Family Room, Great Room, Living Room, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Must have appointment with listing agent. Property is located in the area of RPV experiencing active land movement and it is affected. Vistitor acciess is at own risk.","False","","","","3265","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Thyme","","4","Place","","Custom Built","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","14500","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Canyon, Catalina, City Lights, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://players.brightcove.net/5782667246001/default_default/index.html?videoId=6355678814112","","","2004","90275","5916","RPRS1&E*"
