manship throughout. Ocean View Dream Home above Trump Golf! Many upgrades including whole interior and exterior painting, vinyl frank flooring, new baseboard, most plumbing fixtures, light fixtures, shower glass door, artist-like details & finishes on the cabinets, stair railing and panels, etc. From the main level featured with huge formal living room, bonus room or office and one-bedroom, open floor style family room with stereo built-in speakers, formal dining, kitchen with stainless steel appliances, a walk-in pantry, entertainment room with a bar and a powder room. Balcony has the best Sunrise, Sunset View across the Catalina Island. The side yard has a lot of space great for BBQ or party. The backyard is featured with a basketball court and the privacy that has no house behind. The upper level has four bedrooms and three bathrooms including master suite with a fireplace, balcony with gorgeous view. The master bathroom with skylight is upgraded as a luxury feature with an oversized shower and walk-in closet. Enjoy the living style of Palos Verdes with its breathtaking views, award-winning schools, and a sophisticated neighborhood. This truly cannot be missed with easy access to the freeway, shopping, trails and parks.","","Family Room, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Multi-Level Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Call or Text Agent Mike Cheung for showing appointment and/or any questions. PLS EMAIL OFFERS TO: COCHEUNG@MSN.COM AND INCLUDE: OFFER, PRE-APPROVAL, PROOF OF FUNDS, DU/LP. Showing with 24 hr. advance notice. THANK YOU FOR SHOWING.","True","","","True","5418","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Palo Vista","","3355","Drive","","","1031 Exchange","","34834","","Single Family Residence","","","Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","","1990","90275","6159","RPRS1-OH*"
