in your own home. A free-standing bathtub that'll make you forget your troubles, an extra-large shower that's practically a personal waterfall, heated floors that'll make you want to walk around barefoot all year, and heated towel warmers that are the epitome of indulgence. But wait, there's more! Ensuite bedrooms make for no more morning lineups, a laundry/craft room for your creative genius, a home theater for epic movie nights, and a recreation room that's as vibrant as your imagination. And guess what? There's a wet bar and kitchenette that are just waiting for your next shindig. Picture disappearing corner glass doors that lead to a huge covered patio. Step outside and take a dip in your salt water pool or unwind in your very own spa. And if you're worried about power outages, fear not ? there's even a backup generator to keep the good times rolling. Tech-savvy much? This home is beyond brilliant. Smart automation that'll have your home anticipating your every need, a Sonos sound system that'll make every day a dance party, CAT6 cable for internet faster than a cheetah, Lutron lighting that's fancier than a five-star restaurant, and a closed circuit security system that'll make you feel like James Bond. Don't let this opportunity slip through your fingers! Reach out now to learn more about this spectacular home and turn your So Cal dreams into a reality. The time to level up your coastal lifestyle is now! Ask your agent to download the ""supplement"" for this listing!","Spanish Tile","Attic, Bonus Room, Den, Dressing Area, Entry, Exercise Room, Family Room, Game Room, Great Room, Home Theatre, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Media Room, Office, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Point Vicente","Palos Verdes","Miraleste","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","contact George at 424.226.2147","True","Priva