.43","**BACK ON THE MARKET** Introducing 44 Sea Cove Drive, a luxurious oasis nestled in the prestigious enclave of Rancho Palos Verdes. Crafted by renowned architect Luis de Moraes, this masterpiece offers an unparalleled blend of sophistication, comfort, and coastal living. Spanning over one acre of prime real estate perched atop the majestic cliffs of Abalone Cove, this single-story masterpiece boasts breathtaking views of the Pacific Ocean, creating a serene retreat for discerning homeowners. Step inside to discover a spacious floor plan, adorned with high-end finishes and extravagant lighting, where every corner showcases meticulous attention to detail. The heart of the home is the gourmet kitchen, featuring quartzite countertops, custom cabinetry, maple-lined cushion closed drawers, and two islands, providing both elegance and functionality. Entertain guests effortlessly in the expansive living areas with open beamed ceilings, a dual-sided fireplace, wide-plank hardwood floors, and glass sliding doors that open to the ocean.  For the ultimate in outdoor entertaining, the detached deck beckons a dinner party, with an outdoor grill and bar, adjacent to the sparkling pool and spa.  A built-in seating area with a cozy fire pit is included, ideal for intimate gatherings. Unwind in the privacy of four luxurious bedrooms, each boasting its en-suite bathroom for added comfort and convenience. The primary suite is a haven of relaxation, featuring a steam shower, and spa-like tub. Embrace an active lifestyle with the home gym overlooking the ocean, perfect for maintaining wellness goals without leaving the comfort of home. And with a four-car garage and gated entry, security and convenience are seamlessly integrated into the estate's design. Embrace the epitome of coastal living and indulge in the best microclimate that Palos Verdes offers, with more sunshine and warmer days than the surrounding areas. Whether you're admiring beautiful sunrises or spectacular sunsets, every moment spent in this extraordinary residence will be cherished. Don't miss this unique opportunity to own a slice of paradise in one of Rancho Palos Verdes' most coveted locations.","Metal","Attic, Dressing Area, Entry, Exercise Room, Family Room, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Retreat, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Easy to show with 2 hours notice please.  Text/call Lisa Poach for appt. 310-997-7563 No lockbox on property Please email all offers including POF and pre-qual to: Lisa.Poach@gmail.com","True","","","True","4509","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Sea Cove","","44","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","14649","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Bluff, Catalina, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","Blinds, Custom Covering, Double Pane Windows, Roller Shields, Screens","1951","90275","5830","RPRS10000SP-OH"
