minimalist luxury and refined coastal design, this contemporary masterpiece spans approximately 9,371 square feet of airy, light-filled interiors ? a home where clean lines meet grand-scale sophistication. Crafted with precision and restraint, the residence is defined by its voluminous spaces, gallery-like flow, and meticulous attention to modern detail. Step inside to a soaring foyer drenched in natural light, where refined stone floors and sleek finishes set the tone for the understated elegance carried throughout the home. Formal living and dining rooms are ideal for elegant entertaining, while the chef?s kitchen ? anchored by a sculptural oversized island ? features top-tier appliances, custom cabinetry, and seamless integration into the casual living space. Designed for those who entertain with intention, the layout balances openness and intimacy with effortless grace. The home offers six expansive en-suite bedrooms and eight baths, including a serene main-level primary suite with sweeping views and private access to the pool terrace. A spa-inspired bathroom and walk-in closets complete the retreat. On the lower level, a generous bonus room awaits transformation into a home theater, screening lounge, or game suite, while a flex space offers potential for a private gym, wellness sanctuary, or executive office. An in-home elevator provides discreet convenience, supporting multigenerational comfort and long-term ease. Outside, resort-style grounds are framed by the Pacific horizon. A shimmering pool, spa, and built-in firepit create a scene as visually stunning as it is functional ? the ultimate canvas for golden-hour entertaining or quiet coastal contemplation. With a 5?6 car garage and long driveway accommodating additional 5-6 vehicles, the estate pairs luxury with lifestyle. Moments from world-class golf at Trump National, coastal trails, and some of the West Coast?s most cinematic ocean vistas, this home is not merely a residence ? it?s a destination.","Tile"