iry, inviting ambiance. The main living area is a bright open space ideal for entertaining or relaxing by the fireplace. The dining area is perfect for intimate dining or large gatherings. Enjoy partial ocean views from the upper level bedrooms. The primary suite has an ensuite bathroom with dual vanities and a large closet. It also has its own loft with a large closet and can be used as an extra work space, library, sitting room, dressing area or other purposes. Additionally, the lower level is a versatile open area which can be used as a gym or a recreational space! Step into the backyard patio located adjacent to the dining area offering space for alfresco dining or barbecues. The welcoming yard is surrounded by flowering plants and fruit trees. Don't miss seeing this house and making an offer!","","All Bedrooms Up, Loft","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","A confirmed appointment necessary to show this property. Please text Jai at 310 489 5335 to get confirmation and lockbox instruction.","","","","","2779","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Via Rivera","","30358","","","","Cash to New Loan","","29920","","Single Family Residence","","","Peek-A-Boo","True","","","","1970","90275","4460","RPRS10000*"
