erfect blend of modern luxury and breathtaking ocean views, making it an ideal haven for those seeking the ultimate costal lifestyle. Spanning over 2,000 square feet of meticulously designed living space and over 10,000 sq ft mostly flat lot, this home has been completely reimagined and fully remodeled to create a true masterpiece. Come inside to discover a seamless fusion of sophistication and comfort, highlighted by gleaming engineered hardwood floors and an abundance of natural light that streams in from every angle. The heart of this home is undoubtedly the open-concept living area, where the Pacific Ocean takes center stage. From the living room to the kitchen and dining area, almost every room in the house offers panoramic views of the pacific ocean, creating a serene and captivating atmosphere for both family and entertainment. Downstair en-suite provides access to the expansive backyard, whether it's for guests or in-law suite.Three additional well-appointed bedrooms upstairs each offers its own unique view, ensuring that everyone can enjoy the magic of coastal living. Welcome to the expansive backyard, where a huge flat lot beckons for family gatherings and outdoor entertainment. Breathe in the fresh ocean air as you dine al fresco on the patio or soak in the tranquility of the surroundings. Nestled in the highly sought-after community, this home offers the perfect balance of serenity and convenience. Enjoy top-rated schools, scenic parks, golf courses, and the vibrant dining and shopping destinations of the Palos Verdes Peninsula. Don't miss the opportunity to make this house your own, where you can wake up to the sound of the waves and savor the beauty of the California coast every day. This is coastal living at its finest. Schedule a showing today and experience the allure of this magnificent ocean-view home for yourself. Paradise awaits!","","Entry, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Multi-Level Bedroom","","Palos Verdes