.51","Welcome to a truly rare bluff top home built with the passion and detail of its owners. It hearkens to an era when craftsmanship and quality was a high priority. Architecturally stunning, this Italian and French designed masterpiece seamlessly blends handcrafted details into a captivating marvel. Pacific Ocean views from Catalina Island to Malibu and the azure waters below; this palatial estate exudes luxury and sophistication throughout. Its gated grand entrance courtyard greets you with gorgeous Juliet balconies, a custom fountain, secluded sitting areas, and beautiful greenery and stone pathways lined with fragrant flowers. The grand entrance invites you in with its graceful arches and carved columns which evoke a sense of timeless elegance; details that command attention. Vaulted ceilings, mosaic inlaid travertine floors, chandeliers and 18th century French lighting sconces are just a few highlights that embrace visitors with a sense of warmth and comfort. This oceanfront villa is surrounded by meticulously landscaped gardens, inviting patio areas and bluff top ocean view relaxation spots. There is also an outdoor fireplace and separate built-in BBQ area. A stunning mosaic inlaid pool and spa invites you to float and relax or dive in and do laps! The Great Room floor plan was designed for elegant entertaining or a casual lifestyle. The home has a richly detailed oceanfront conservatory room that bathes you in its streaming natural light and scenes of the sky. The kitchen creates a chef's dream with an elegant center island, all framed with high-end appliances. The bedroom wing is highlighted with a luxurious ocean view primary suite that incorporates a spectacular library/sitting room with a fireplace, spa like bathroom and a grand walk-in closet. Three additional bedrooms offer an abundance of space all with en-suite bathrooms. Adjacent to the bedrooms is a loft area that is perfect for a game room, gym, music studio, meditation or media room. Located in its own wing is a fully equipped private office retreat with en-suite bathroom and beautifully designed wine cellar with temperature control. There is a residents' tennis court and clubhouse for the 30 (approx) homes in this exclusive Lunada Pointe community. Rarely does a home in this location become available in our coastal region. Located in the community of renowned Terranea Resort, Trump Golf Course, and the great Palos Verdes School District. *Some photos have been virtually staged.","Spanish Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Bonus Room, Den, Entry, Exercise Room, Game Room, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Library, Loft, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite, Office, Recreation, Retreat, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Call Kevin Moen 310 466-4656 to schedule appointment. Brokers open house: Tuesday May 7th 11am - 2pm","False","Private, In Ground","True","True","7300","Taped","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Marguerite","","71","Drive","","Mediterranean","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","40640","","Single Family Residence","","Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic, White Water","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=nUDn1ESRf25&mls=1","","Blinds, Drapes","1998","90275","4476","RPOH-RS1RPD"
