er and dual sinks, all designed with tasteful touches. Upstairs, the home?s versatility shines, with a flexible landing area perfect for an office, creative workspace, or reading nook. Additionally, a room previously used as a dance studio offers endless possibilities for your lifestyle needs. This level also includes a bedroom, another bathroom and a relaxing sauna for ultimate comfort. Backing up to the scenic Los Verdes Golf Course, the backyard provides tranquil views and a serene atmosphere for outdoor living. With thoughtful updates, abundant flexible spaces, and breathtaking surroundings, this home truly stands out as a unique gem.","","Dance Studio, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Seller requires a minimum of 2 hours' notice. Please contact the listing agent for further instructions.","False","","","","4222","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Vallon","","6777","Drive","","","Conventional, Subject To Other","","28083","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Park/Greenbelt","True","","","","1967","90275","5358","RPRAIA"
