all amenities, firepit and large grass area for kids with the potential of a pool and more. As you enter the bedroom wing you will find the large primary bedroom with a sitting area, large bathroom with heated floors and steam shower along with a walk in closet. The other bedrooms and bathrooms stretch down the hall which has a bonus room for a theatre or game room. Some of the extras this home provides is solar that is owned, a backup generator for power, whole home filtration for the water, Sonos system and speakers in almost every room as well as bonus space downstairs which can be used for a gym, workshop and tons of storage. The owner has recently refinished the hardwood floors, installed new carpet, painted inside and outside, completed roof work, completed termite work, new glass shower doors in the primary bath and much more. This home is NOT located in the current slide area of Rancho Palos Verdes.","","Bonus Room, Exercise Room, Family Room, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet, Workshop","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Text Keith at 310-944-5554 with day and time for showing. Do not approach property without an appointment","True","None","False","True","3952","Estimated","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Matisse","","30216","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","25160","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Ocean","True","","","","1976","90275","5734","RPRS20000*"
