ragon granite counters and marble/granite flooring.  The big bonus room can be used as a family room, game room or exercise room that opens to the outside.  The home also features 8 TVs with remotes, a very efficient and comfortable underfloor heating system with individual zone control in each room, and owner owned Solar PV for electricity.  See supplement for other features.  Truly a very special home to own and enjoy!","Clay, Tile","All Bedrooms Up, Entry, Family Room, Home Theatre, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Media Room, Office, See Remarks, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Point Vicente","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Ridgecrest","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","No sign or lockbox.  Please make appointment with Listing Agents to show,  24 hr notice would be appreciated.  Thank you! Cora Fischer (310) 213-7393 Yoko Mendelson (310) 383-0469","False","None","False","True","5682","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Cartier","","30156","Drive","","Mediterranean","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","25160","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://tour.caimagemaker.com/l/?id=179992IDX","https://tour.caimagemaker.com/Viewer/FpV5.asp?ID=179992","Blinds, Custom Covering, Double Pane Windows, Plantation Shutters, Screens, Stained Glass","2013","90275","5720",""
