mmunity, Smoke Detector(s)","Assessor","","","PV23215929","","3","3","","1","Owner","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Garage Faces Front, Garage - Two Door, Garage Door Opener","True","Concrete, Patio Open","True","49","","Private, In Ground","True","Close Of Escrow","823.31","Located in the gated Rolling Hills Park Estates community, this wonderful executive home has great curb appeal, functional floor plan, a large swimming pool and 2 grassy yards to play and entertain. Exquisite renovation in 2013 encompassed many aspects of this residence, featuring a captivating entrance foyer adorned with distinguished marble parquet flooring and an opulent Schonbeck Century Collection crystal chandelier, setting the tone for luxury and elegance. The living room boasts a magnificent 2-story high ceiling, a warming fireplace, and expansive windows that flood the space with natural light. It flows seamlessly into the formal dining room, adorned with a coffered ceiling that creates an elegant ambiance. The family room is a haven of relaxation, featuring a cozy fireplace, Bose surround sound entertainment system and a wet bar. The gourmet kitchen has been expansively redesigned, showcasing a magnificent 15 ft oval DuPont artificial marble centerpiece, complemented by top-of-the-line appliances including a Viking Professional 48-inch Double Door refrigerator, a Viking Professional 48-inch Gas Range, a Viking Professional built-in microwave oven, and a Miele built-in coffee machine. Custom-built dining room display cabinets and drawers provide ample storage, adding both functionality and style to the space. A walk-in pantry and an adjacent laundry room further increase the functional charm. A guest/in-law bedroom en-suite on the main level also provides both privacy and convenience. On the Upper Level, the primary bedroom suite includes a sitting area with fireplace. The primary bathroom has undergone a complete transformation, featuring a spacious walk-in closet, a reconfigured shower and a standalone bathtub, as well as built-in double sinks and cabinets. A Toto automatic toilet further enhances the modern, luxurious feel of the space. Meanwhile, two additional generously sized bedrooms share a full hallway bathroom, providing comfort for family and guests. Step outside from the family room or kitchen to a beautiful large yard, featuring a sparkling pool and ample space for a BBQ area for entertaining friends and family. Additionally, a state-of-the-art water softener system has been installed, ensuring the highest quality of water throughout the home. Amenities in the gated community include 4 tennis courts, horse facilities, horse trails, and a park. This is more than a home; it's a lifestyle you will enjoy for years to come.","","Entry, Foyer, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Vista Grande","Peninsula","Ridgecrest","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","For all showings, please call/text Cindy Carter at 310-388-2533 to set it up. When you reach the community gate's call box, please push 523 (Highridge gate) or 533 (Hawthorne gate), then push ""call"" button, the phone will ring at Cindy Carter's cell phone and she will open the community gate for you.","","None","False","","3492","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Arrowhead","","12","Lane","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","30420","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Trees/Woods","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/455640","","Plantation Shutters","1978","90274","4818","RERPD2U*"
