e elegant homes that flow in luxury uniform. At the end of a cul-de-sac, you will find 47 Santa Catalina Drive, a stunning 5 bedroom and 4.5 bathroom home with remarkable features and quality. Upon entering the home, you are greeted by the grand foyer with its vaulted ceilings and an impressive curved staircase. The foyer opens up to the formal living room with beautiful casement windows, high ceilings, surround sound speakers, and a fireplace; which seamlessly connects to the large formal dining room with French doors that look out to the green landscape. Enjoy cooking in the remodeled chef?s kitchen with custom cabinetry and pullouts throughout, a built-in Thermador fridge, island, and breakfast nook. Off the kitchen is the family room that is perfect for entertaining as it hosts an elegant wet bar, surround sound speakers, fireplace, and French doors that lead to the pergola covered backyard, ideal for indoor/outdoor fun! The private backyard offers a heated saltwater pool with a saline filter, jacuzzi, ample hardscape space, and two large grass areas; great for hosting large gatherings! Additional features to note on the first floor include the powder room with Crema Marfil marble, the fifth bedroom (used as an office) with a fully remodeled ensuite bathroom, laundry, and direct access to the 3 car garage. Upstairs hosts an oversized primary suite with its own private balcony, three closets, and a custom fully remodeled bathroom with a soaking tub and marble tile. There are three additional bedrooms upstairs (one with an ensuite), a fully remodeled shared bathroom, and a massive bonus room equipped with the third fireplace, wooden beamed ceilings, and a balcony with peak-a-boo ocean views; perfect for a play room or additional lounging area to enjoy the sunsets. A few more features include a new HVAC system and ductwork, hardwood floors, new non-toxic and chemical free wool carpet, zero VOC paint throughout, and new exterior paint. The Island View community come