 as a breakfast bar, surrounded by high-end stainless-steel appliances and a striking stone backsplash. A charming breakfast nook, encircled by windows, seamlessly connects to the family room with a beautiful stack stone fireplace and travertine floors, creating a warm, inviting ambiance. From here, access the backyard oasis through sliding doors. Outside, enjoy the epitome of alfresco living with a herringbone brick patio, complemented by a custom U-shaped outdoor kitchen. Equipped with a top-of-the-line grill, refrigerator, beverage cooler, sink, and ample prep space, this outdoor kitchen sits under a pergola, ideal for entertaining. Beyond the kitchen, the backyard boasts a large pool, spa, spacious grassy area, and a dedicated bathroom for convenience. Back inside, a well-equipped laundry room offers ample cabinetry, a sink, and space for an extra refrigerator, ensuring functionality for day-to-day living. Also on the main level, a comfortable en-suite guest room provides privacy and convenience for visitors. Upstairs, retreat to the luxurious primary suite, featuring a cozy fireplace, private balcony overlooking the backyard and vaulted ceilings. The suite also includes a spacious sitting area, a lavish bathroom with a soaking tub, and expansive his-and-hers walk-in closets. The additional bedrooms on this level are generously sized, each with updated bathrooms, providing ample space for family or guests. An additional flexible room on this floor can be easily converted into a bedroom, a secondary living space, or a home office. This sophisticated residence is designed to offer a harmonious blend of elegance, comfort, and functionality, making it a truly exceptional property in Rolling Hills Estates.","See Remarks","Family Room, Foyer, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please give 24 hour notice if possible. Appointment only.","","In Ground","True","","4040","Assessor