ebuilt with an uncompromising commitment to craftsmanship, blending the essence of mid-century elegance with the finest in modern luxury. Walls of glass frame ever-changing vistas, creating an ethereal feeling of floating above the Pacific, where sunrises and sunsets become part of your daily ritual. Ideal for entertaining on a grand scale or savoring intimate moments, the home offers an ambiance of refined sophistication. Featuring 4 expansive ensuite bedrooms and 5 luxuriously appointed baths, the floor plan provides ample privacy while inviting comfort and style at every turn. A chic game room adds a touch of leisure, while a versatile garden room or creative studio expands the home?s functionality. Additionally, a generous storage room can effortlessly transform into a secure playroom, wine cellar, or wellness retreat. The property also features a spacious three car garage, complete with a well appointed work area, ideal for the automotive enthusiast, hobbyist, or those who value ample storage. Signature Palos Verdes stone, quarried directly from the grounds, is masterfully integrated throughout the property, grounding the home in a natural, earthy elegance rarely found today. Outside, a tranquil koi pond enhances the serene ambiance. Easily convertible into a custom pool should your vision call for it. This is more than a residence; it is a private sanctuary, a collector's piece of architectural art, and an irreplaceable opportunity to own a slice of Southern California history, crafted for the most discerning buyer seeking unmatched views, provenance, and prestige. Please see the link for video.","Stone","Bonus Room, Center Hall, Family Room, Formal Entry, Game Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Separate Family Room, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet, Workshop","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","Fal