med the home and added over 550 sq ft, creating the ultimate smart home with all functions on an app. As the front door opens with impressive views of hills and sea, you are struck with the blending of nature and form as the chosen elements inside merge seamlessly with the outside.  The sophisticated choices - Gaggenau appliances throughout kitchen (with anthracite porcelain slab counters), rift grey blanco and matte flooring, Ann Sacks tile and Waterworks plumbing fixtures - only enhance the natural light coming externally.  The home is approximately 5485 square feet with 6 bedrooms and 5 baths, with huge open spaces for living and entertaining well.  There are many homes on the Hill that have views, but very few combine those views with an artfully-assembled design aesthetic.  This is one of the few.  This property is also for lease at $30,000 per month","","Family Room, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","24 hr notice required","True","Private","True","","5458","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Ocean Terrace","","5832","Drive","","Contemporary, Modern","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","31617","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=rJbPb8zPSUV&mls=1","","","1985","90275","5759","RPRS20000*"
