ate, In Ground","True","","1083.08","*View* View* View* Enjoy Breathtaking Panoramic Ocean Views ,Catalina Island Views, Lush Canyon Scenery and more*** This majestic one of a kind two-story contemporary design has been recently remodeled with meticulous attention to detail and high-end finishes. As you enter the residence, you'll be welcomed by a circular driveway that gracefully leads to a charming fountain. Additionally, 2 stately garages, that accommodate 4 cars. Continuing your journey, you'll cross a beautiful bridge that spans over the garden swimming pool and spa below, creating a magical grand main entry that has the most spectacular views from the large wall of windows and custom glass doors. The living room has a custom  marble fireplace surround, soaring ceilings, a built-in custom cabinetry. The family room invites relaxation with its built-in cabinetry, wet bar, and cozy fireplace.The ocean-view kitchen is a chef's dream, featuring custom cabinetry, marble countertops, marble wainscoting, and luxurious granite flooring. Equipped with top-of-the-line built-in appliances, a separate prep pantry, and a convenient half bathroom. Each of the four bedrooms on the first level provides a private sanctuary, showcasing custom bathrooms adorned with exquisite marble wainscoting, flooring, and countertops. The second level divides into two distinct bedroom wings; one consists of a spacious master suite featuring an elegant sitting area, two walk-in closets, and a luxurious master bathroom with a walk-in steam shower and a soaking tub, all adorned with custom marble wainscoting and countertops.  The other wing consists of a loft and a bonus room that is currently utilized as a gym, along with a private balcony, elegant bathroom and hardwood flooring throughout. The additional room above one of the garages has a built in custom cabinetry, a balcony, and a full bathroom. Additional features further enhance the residence, such as a security system, starfire glass installed for fencing and loft area , automatic gates at driveway entrance. Smooth stucco exterior, recessed lighting throughout, extended rear patio , pillars, newer interior paint throughout, all newer custom doors and windows, newer garage doors, newer custom starlite railings on loft stairwell. Prepare to be captivated by the beauty and elegance of this remarkable residence, where every detail has been thoughtfully designed to provide a truly exceptional living experience.","","Entry, Formal Entry, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Vista Grande","Palos Verdes Peninsula","","","","","","","2","%","","","False","Full Service","Appointment only Please call or Text Jeannette at 562-396-3876.","False","Private, In Ground","True","","7848","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Ocean Terrace","","6224","Drive","","Contemporary","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","31617","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Bluff, Catalina, Coastline, Golf Course, Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","","1989","90275","5765","RPRS20000*"
