 Kitchen, Washer Hookup, Washer Included","True","False","","","1450000","","","1688800","#ERR","310 721-2167","","john_delaire@yahoo.com","","John","","","Munn","","SMUNNJOH","","","","","SB1305980","","San Pedro Real Estate Company","310 721-2167","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.399866","","6","10882","Sloped Down, Landscaped, Irregular Lot, Park Nearby, Sprinkler System, Sprinklers Timer","Gutters, Sidewalks, Storm Drains, Street Lights","Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Smoke Detector(s)","Assessor","","","SB25059376","","2","2","2","1","Owner","","","","","Driveway, Garage, Garage - Single Door, Garage Door Opener","True","Deck, Patio Open, Wood","True","35","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","811.87","Ocean view elegance in prestigious Rancho Palos Verdes. Discover an extraordinary opportunity to own a luxurious four bedroom home with panoramic ocean views, stretching from Malibu to Catalina Island. Nestled in the exclusive 'Los Verdes' neighborhood, this property sits high on the verdant Palos Verdes Peninsula, surrounded by an enclave of opulent dream homes. This serene and secure neighborhood, with streets seldom traveled by outsiders, offers the tranquility of a private oasis. The spacious backyard deck, framed by shade trees and vibrant jacaranda, provides a stunning retreat where you can unwind while taking in inspiring views of Malibu and the vast Pacific Ocean. On the main level, the kitchen has nicely tiled floors, modern stainless appliances, and an expansive ocean view including Santa Barbara Island. It opens seamlessly to a large dining room with high vaulted ceilings and hardwood floors, which add a nice touch of contrast between finishes.  Two nice sized bedrooms are here with high, open beam ceilings, hardwood floors, and ocean views to Malibu. There's a discreet but convenient, readily accessible 3/4 bathroom here as well. From the dining room, large sliding glass doors open directly to the expansive backyard deck, inviting natural light and ocean breezes into the home.   Down from the main floor is a large split level living room where you'll welcome your guests. Relax in front of the inviting, gas assisted, real wood-burning fireplace. You'll love the ambiance of it's stone hearth and newer, real hardwood floors.  Up from the main level, you'll find two spacious bedrooms with inspiring views to Catalina Island. Their high ceilings with stylish, exposed wood beams add style and flair. One has accent windows that flood it with light and opens the exposure to the sea.  There's also a full bath here that's newly renovated with jetted tub, beautiful tile and pristine quartz countertop. 4 Bed / 2 Bath. 1,786 square feet on a huge 10,882 square foot lot with a 2 car garage. Laundry area has 220 power and gas connect. Newer dual pane windows, all appliances included, newer water heater and central heating system. Excellent public school system with its own,well-known, award winning school district. Close to parks, beaches, shopping(including the Promenade PV Shopping Mall), restaurants, entertainment(including the Norris Theater) and a top rated public golf course with driving range(Los Verdes Golf Course).","Composition","Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Multi-Level Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Vista Grande","Palos Verdes","Ridgecrest","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Need 24 hours advanced notice. Cat on property. Supra lockbox located up stairs to the left under the handrail. Use key on sliding glass door.","True","None","False","True","1786","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Ambergate","","28130","Drive","","Traditional","Cash, Conventional, FHA, Submit","","25801","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://www.wellcomemat.com/mls/5ait6505f9a51m53q","","Double Pane Windows","1970","90275","2906","R