indows framing breathtaking panoramic views of the sparkling Pacific Ocean. Natural light floods the room, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere. The kitchen, although in its original state, offers ample space and provides an excellent opportunity to design a culinary haven tailored to your tastes. Consider preparing your favorite meals while gazing out at the vast ocean. The five bedrooms offer plenty of space for your family, guests, or even a home office or hobby room. The three bathrooms provide everyone with convenience and comfort. Step outside to find a tranquil haven and an entertainer's paradise. The spacious backyard provides limitless opportunities for creating your own oasis, from hosting lively gatherings to quiet relaxation. The majestic ocean view provides a stunning backdrop for experiencing breathtaking sunsets and starlit nights. This home in Rancho Palos Verdes is located in a highly desirable neighborhood known for its schools, natural beauty, and tranquil surroundings. Enjoy the close proximity to beautiful hiking trails, picturesque parks, and the community's charm. Don't miss your chance to make this haven yours and experience coastal living at its finest.","","All Bedrooms Up, Kitchen, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Vista Grande","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Ridgecrest","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Please contact listing manager Terri Zech 215-779-0073","","","","","2440","Estimated","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Trailriders","","28503","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","27133","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","","","","1964","90275","3049","RPRS10000*"
"","0.1608","Please call or text LA for all showings. Submit all offers to isaac@isaaccarusohomes.com and include Pre-Approval and POF. Listing agent is related to seller. Buyer and buyers agent to perform their own due diligence and investigations in all aspects pertaining to the house and property including square footage, permits, surveys, property lines, and school zones. Neither Seller Broker/Agents guarantee the accuracy of the square footage, lot size, permits, etc.","Dishwasher, Microwave, Refrigerator","True","173 - Los Verdes","","False","7583003030","","","","False","3","0","0","0","3","5","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Co-Agent Email","","","Los Angeles","132","2049000","#ERR","05/15/2025 1:18:16 AM","","07/22/2025 8:02:00 AM","09/24/2025 12:00:00 AM","09/24/2025 11:42:12 AM","","","05/15/2025 12:00:00 AM","","07/28/2025 5:43:51 PM","","09/24/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","132","","","","","","","","","","Living Room","True","Carpet, Tile, Wood","True","Central, Fireplace(s)","True","Ceiling Fan(s)","True","True","Call Listing Agent","","","","","","33.774698","Dryer Included, In Garage, Washer Included","True","","","","2049000","","","2449000","#ERR","310-947-5077","","isaac@isaaccarusohomes.com","","Isaac","","","Caruso","","CLW-C137232","","","","","CLW-X7252104","818-380-5201","Equity Union","818-989-2000","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.400948","67x104","","7005","","","","","","","25539161","","","2","","","Owner","","","","","Driveway, Garage, Garage - Two Door","True","","","40","","None","False","","913.92","Tucked into a quiet residential street, 6923 Willowtree Dr is a beautiful fully remodeled two-story home that blends modern design with everyday comfort. Move-in ready, this 5-bedroom, 3-bathroom home offers a rare blend of modern comfort, thoughtful design, and outdoor living - all in a quiet, desirable neighborhood near the coast. The main level features a spacious living room with a classic fireplace, an open dining area that flows to the backyard, and a beautiful kitchen outfitted with custom cabinetry, marble finishes, and high-end stainless steel appliances. Also on this level is a versatile room - currently used as a home gym - is located near a full bathroom, while the attached two-car garage offers direct access, built-in ceiling storage, and a new washer/dryer setup. Upstairs, five well-sized bedrooms and two bathrooms provide comfort and flexibility. Each space has been meticulously maintained and refreshed, offering a quiet sense of privacy and endless versatility - perfect for family living, hosting guests, working from home, or creating something new. The primary suite features its own private bath, while other rooms enjoy views of the backyard and even a glimpse of the ocean.The private backyard is built for California living, featuring a custom pergola, built-in BBQ, pizza oven, ambient lighting, and fresh landscaping - perfect for hosting or relaxing outdoors. With extensive upgrades throughout, including new HVAC, windows, plumbing, and flooring, this home is truly turn-key and ready to enjoy. Located just minutes from the Peninsula Shopping Center and the Promenade on the Peninsula, you'll have easy access to a variety of shops, restaurants, and entertainment options. For outdoor enthusiasts, several parks and recreational areas are in close proximity, offering ample opportunities for leisure and exploration.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Call/text or email LA1. Showing Information: Call LA 1,24-hr Notice,Text LA 1,Do Not Contact Occupant,Appointment Only,Alarm on Property ","True","None","False","","2242","","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Willowtree","","6923","Drive","","Contemporary","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","","","","1963","90275","2958