 expanded primary suite with private balcony.  The backyard is a summer dream complete with pool, waterslide, diving board, and built-in BBQ all framed by the Pacific. Inside, move right in or there?s room to reimagine and personalize, with space that can flex for work, guests, or extended family. Recent updates include refreshed interiors and a layout that lets you better envision your dream design. The spacious first floor room is ready to be reimagined as another living room, gym, office or 4th bedroom downstairs if desired. One key improvement that offers peace of mind for the next owner is a newly rebuilt block wall, fully permitted, inspected, and now signed off by the City for the beautification of the community.  Located outside of any landslide zone, this upgrade adds long-term value.  Even if you?ve seen 5726 Sunmist before, it?s time for a second look.  Set up a showing today and start planning your move. This is a home with good bones, great energy, and an ocean breeze waiting to greet you.","","All Bedrooms Up, Entry, Kitchen, Living Room, Recreation, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Soleado","Other","Ridgecrest","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please select a time on showing time and wait for confirmation before going.  Property is occupied.","True","None","False","True","2506","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Multi/Split ","","","Sunmist","","5726","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","27789","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Ocean","True","https://youtu.be/eTRdE6lcLfg","https://www.zillow.com/view-imx/ed05806d-c3d8-4f06-96ac-d7015cc1e971?wl=true&setAttribution=mls&initialViewType=pano","Blinds, Drapes, Screens, Skylight(s)","1964","90275","4939","RPRS10000*"
