nparalleled sense of tranquility and serenity. This Mediterranean-inspired residence seamlessly blends elegance with comfort. Once you step into the door, a spacious living area, complete with a fireplace, provides the perfect setting for both relaxation and entertainment, while large windows frame breathtaking views. The formal dining room offers an intimate ambiance for hosting family gatherings and dinner parties. The newly remodeled gourmet kitchen is a culinary enthusiast's dream complete with a wine/drink cooler, and new cabinetry.  Retreat to the primary suite, where the views continue to captivate from large windows. The spacious walk-in closet offers plenty of space for clothes and storage. The ensuite bathroom with a soaking tub, dual vanities, and a walk-in shower. Additional bedrooms provide ample space for guests or family members, each offering comfort and style.  Conveniently located near Crenshaw and Hawthorne, it's close distance to shops, restaurants, parks, schools, and trails.","Tile","All Bedrooms Up","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Soleado","","Ridgecrest","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Go direct. Night time view is surreal, please feel free to show at night time as supra is set until 10pm. Thank you for showing. Please submit offers with preapproval and POF to janet@janetchengroup.com.","True","None","False","True","3068","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Oceanridge","","29152","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","28584","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Panoramic","True","","","","1965","90275","4908","RPRS10000*"
