eamlessly blending the quintessential charm of Old-World California with all the modern conveniences of a state-of-the-art SMART HOME at your fingertips. This Palos Verdes oasis is located on top of the hill, steps from ocean view hikes, tranquil walks & idyllic parks, excellent schools & a quick drive from Terranea to Peninsula Center. -Design inspired by Coastal CA?s Spanish heritage that spared no expense in each & every detail. - 2 car garage with large shared driveway able to accommodate another 4 cars; Unlimited street parking. - Breathtaking & easily maintained landscaping with auto-sprinkler system; Stucco privacy wall accented with wrought iron fencing & gates. - Extensive wrought iron lighting fixtures throughout, custom-made in Mexico; High-end hardwood flooring; Hand-painted stone tiles. - 2 HVAC; Central vacuum; ADT security system with CCTV; Smart Home with video intercom & cellphone command capabilities; Tankless water heater; Plentiful storage. MAIN LEVEL: - Gorgeous Entry Foyer leading to an airy step-down Living Room with Mexican tiled ?smart? fireplace. - Dining Room with majestic iron French doors leading to a hardscaped backyard perfect for entertaining; additional space for a potential putting green, dog run, jacuzzi/sun deck, a fabulous home vegetable garden, or whatever you can dream of. - Hand-carved double doors lead to a luxurious Master Suite; Walk-in closet; Ensuite master bath with freestanding tub, double sinks, hand-painted stone tiles & oversized shower. - Stunning Chef?s Kitchen with oversized island; Quartzite countertops with honed marble backsplash; Custom-built cabinetry (coconut/maritime combo) with all the bells & whistles; Sub-zero & Wolf appliances; Pull- out drawer microwave; Wine Cooler; Giant double pantries; Pot filler?this amazing kitchen has it all. - Family/T.V. room off the kitchen for maximum ?togetherness?; adjoining private breakfast patio. - Large guest bedroom with ensuite bathroom & private access to the backyard. SECOND FLOOR: - Grand staircase with hand-painted stone tile accents; Majestic wrought- iron staircase pendant lighting. - Loft-style den/office/man or kid cave (or is it man nest?); private balcony with sweeping views of the ocean & Catalina Island. - 2 addtl bedrooms; Charming ? bathroom with oversized shower.","Spanish Tile","Den, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Please make an appointment with the listing agent, preferably 24 hours in advance. Text or call accepted.","False","None","False","True","3014","Plans","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Highridge","","29970","Road","","Spanish","Cash, Conventional","","3981718","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Available, Natural Gas Available, Phone Available, Sewer Available, Water Available","Catalina, Ocean","True","","","Blinds, Drapes","2021","90274","","RECL*"
