and an open layout perfect for entertaining. A recently added refrigerator, dishwasher, and a separate washer/dryer in the laundry area provide modern convenience.  Enjoy cozy evenings in the private family room with fireplace, and take advantage of the downstairs bedroom with a full bath?ideal for guests or multi-generational living. Upstairs, you?ll find four spacious bedrooms, all enhanced with recessed lighting and double-paned windows for energy efficiency and comfort. The luxurious Primary Suite includes a walk-in closet, a spa-inspired bathroom with separate tub and shower, a fireplace, and a private balcony with spectacular ocean views?a perfect retreat to unwind and soak in the beauty of the Pacific. The backyard is an entertainer?s dream, complete with lush turf grass, room for play, and a built-in BBQ station?all overlooking the stunning ocean view.  Situated in a prime location near several fantastic parks, top-rated Palos Verdes schools, and the Peninsula Center shopping and dining; this home offers the ideal blend of luxury, location, and lifestyle.  Don?t miss your chance to own one of the best ocean view homes in Palos Verdes!","Tar/Gravel, Tile","Family Room, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Easy to show - just need to pick up from kids and dog.. call or text to schedule","True","None","False","","2940","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Shire Oaks","","28631","Drive","","Traditional","Cash To Existing Loan","","27936","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Ocean, Panoramic, Water","True","https://youtu.be/11ZCCPNZEA8?si=UwTxciY68JVDGsKv","","","1969","90275","4757","RPRS10000*"
