e epitome of contemporary living. The open-concept layout seamlessly connects indoor and outdoor spaces, making it ideal for both intimate gatherings and grand-scale entertaining. Step into the expansive living area, where floor-to-ceiling folding windows frame the sparkling ocean and Catalina Island views, filling the home with natural light. The gourmet kitchen features state-of-the-art appliances, sleek cabinetry, and a large island, perfect for culinary creations and socializing alike. Outdoors, you'll find your own private oasis?a stunning pool and spa area surrounded by beautiful landscaping, amazing firepit area, with plenty of space to lounge, dine, and enjoy the California sunshine. The built-in BBQ and outdoor kitchen covered by marvelous awning make it easy to host memorable gatherings with friends and family.  On the lower level, you'll discover two well-appointed bedrooms and a beautifully remodeled bathroom. The entertainment room is designed to be the ultimate gathering spot, perfect for creating lasting memories. A stylish bar with a mini fridge is conveniently located, making it easy to entertain guests. Upstairs, there are three additional bedrooms, including the luxurious main suite, which features stunning ocean views and an expansive walk-in closet with custom built-ins. The main bathroom is a bright, airy retreat, offering a grand walk-in shower, double sinks, and ample cabinetry for storage. This exquisite property is more than just a home; it?s a lifestyle. Enjoy the peace and privacy of cul-de-sac living while being just minutes away from top-rated Palos Verdes Unified schools, shopping, and dining and entertainment. Don?t miss your chance to own this exceptional modern retreat in one of Southern California?s most coveted coastal communities!","","Attic, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","### CHANGE IN LIFE PLANS! Sellers NOT GOING