the beautiful San Gabriel Mountains. 2,800 square feet of living space, and a 36,000 square foot lot, provide ample room. On the entry level, the primary or guest suite has a separate area for a home office, movie viewing, or a living room for long-term guests. The beautifully remodeled kitchen has top-of-the-line appliances, a large pantry, a breakfast island, and is open to the dining area. Just a few steps up is the great room with built-in entertainment center and custom fireplace. In the bedroom wing, there is a second primary bedroom with en-suite bath and walk-in closet, two additional large bedrooms, and a full bath. Outside this privately-sited home, there are no homes visible across the street, and the backyard has three levels to enjoy. The patio level off the great room, spans the entire house, and has a built-in barbeque center. The middle level?s 500 square foot sundeck has a wonderful view, and the top level, is the piece-de-resistance, with a fantastic view, and a sport court set up for pickleball, volleyball, and basketball. All this, plus award-winning schools, convenient shopping, great restaurants, and easy access to the Beach Cities, and LAX.  Be sure to look at the video!","","Entry, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Do not use Showing Time.  Call or Text Listing Agent with at least one hour notice.  Listing agent must accompany.","True","None","False","","2794","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Multi/Split ","","","Silver Moon Lane","","27037","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","28421","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Mountain(s), Panoramic","True","https://bcove.video/4bCpqNK","","Double Pane Windows, Plantation Shutters, Skylight(s)","1967","90275","3734",""
