argest usable lots on Browndeer Lane. Nestled in the heart of the Palos Verdes Peninsula, this 5-bedroom, 3-bath gem has constantly been remodeled and improved for the past 10 years, combining modern elegance with everyday functionality. From the moment you arrive, the inviting curb appeal and covered front porch set the tone. Inside, rich walnut hardwood floors flow through the open-concept living and dining areas, anchored by a cozy fireplace and access to the recreation backyard. The vaulted ceiling in the gourmet kitchen exudes spaciousness, featuring quartz countertops, custom cabinetry, and a sunny breakfast nook, with direct access to the side yard. A laundry room is also nearby for added convenience. ON THE LOWER LEVEL, a large family room with a wet bar, fireplace, and sliding door that opens to a grassy area is perfect for personal enjoyment and entertaining. Two versatile bedrooms on this level offer ideal space for everyday use, guests, a home office or gym, with a full bathroom nearby. ON THE UPPER LEVEL, the tranquil primary suite overlooks the lush backyard and includes dual closet areas and an ensuite bathroom with double sinks. Two additional bedrooms on this level share a beautifully remodeled hallway bathroom. Privately surrounded by lush landscape, the backyard is a true highlight?featuring a lower-level grassy lawn, an upper patio with a gazebo for outdoor living and BBQ setup, and an oversized gated side yard ideal for RV parking, kids? play, or large gatherings. With ample storage and room to expand, the possibilities are endless. Located near top-rated schools like Soleado Elementary and Peninsula High, and just minutes from scenic coastlines, shopping, and outdoor recreation?this home offers the best of Palos Verdes living.","","Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Multi-Level Bedroom, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","Peninsula","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Property is sti