"","0.385","Still under contract/putting back on market - please do no contact/bother owners.  Submit offers to Erik @ erik@hollywoodestates.com and call/text to confirm receipt. Seller to choose all services. Property sold ""as-is"" - no repairs or credits. Buyer and buyer agent to verify any and all details regarding the home to their satisfaction. Broker does not guarantee the accuracy of the information provided, including but not limited to square footage, lot size, and all information concerning this property. The 4th bedroom is technically an office (no closet).","Dishwasher, Disposal, Gas Cooktop, Microwave, Oven, Range, Range Hood, Refrigerator","True","176 - Silver Spur","","False","7578028026","","","","","3","1","0","2","0","4","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Co-Agent Email","","","Los Angeles","27","1799000","#ERR","05/07/2025 12:00:00 AM","","05/27/2025 11:16:40 AM","06/03/2025 12:00:00 AM","06/07/2025 4:02:14 PM","","","05/07/2025 12:00:00 AM","","05/29/2025 7:42:04 PM","","06/03/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","27","","","Dining Room","","Stucco","","","","","Living Room","True","Tile","True","Central","True","","True","True","","","","","","","33.780055","Inside","True","False","","","1799000","","","1875000","#ERR","310-989-9166","","erik@hollywoodestates.com","","Erik","","","Lim","","CLW-C143284","","","","","CLW-X8257519","","Hollywood Estates","310-704-1794","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.387294","116x145","","16769","Flag Lot","","","","","","25530513","","","4","","","Owner","","","","","Driveway, Garage - Two Door, Private, Street","True","Rear Porch, Wrap Around","True","26","","None","False","","825.99","**PRICE IMPROVEMENT** Best value in PV!  (Extra large primary room with many closets.  Renovated bathrooms. Partial new engineered wood flooring. Fresh interior and exterior paint. Central AC/heating and tankless water heater. New landscaping. Clean, renovated and move-in ready.)  Welcome to the ""Monero Residence,"" a beautifully updated single-level home tucked away on a quiet street in the heart of Rancho Palos Verdes with peek-a-boo views of SoFi Stadium and LA city lights.  Situated on an expansive, private lot, this move-in ready residence offers the ideal blend of comfort, charm, and functionality for family living. The updated kitchen features quartz countertops, stainless steel appliances, a cozy breakfast nook, and a lovely view of the neighborhood. Just beyond, you'll find a spacious living and dining area ideal for hosting guests or relaxing with loved ones. A versatile bonus room with pocket doors can serve as a family room, playroom, or 4th bedroom.  The spacious primary suite includes a bay window, backyard access, and a beautifully renovated ensuite bath with double vanities and a walk-in shower. The second and third bedrooms are generously sized, ideal for kids' rooms, guest rooms, or home offices. All bathrooms have been recently renovated, including a permitted third bathroom addition. Additional upgrades include recessed lighting, crown molding, and included appliances (fridge, washer, dryer). The private backyard is a peaceful retreat surrounded by lush greenery with dedicated areas for a BBQ, firepit, and outdoor seating. It's perfect for family gatherings, entertaining, kids to play, or dogs to roam. Located near top-rated Palos Verdes schools, hiking trails, beaches, golf courses, tennis clubs, and the Peninsula Shopping Center. Zoned for Montemalaga Elementary (9/10), PV Intermediate (10/10), and PV Peninsula High (10/10).","","Bonus Room, Den, Office","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Come tour during open houses. Owner occupied but can easily schedule a showing with notice. Showing Information: Text LA 1,Call LA 1,Appointment Only,Do Not Contact Occupant ","","None","False","","