s. Your suite also comes w/ Built-In Speakers, an A/V cubby, a large sliding door leading to a Spacious Concrete Deck & Incredible Sunrise Views! Additional Features Include: HVAC w/ Dual Zone A/C Units, Tankless Water Heater, Copper Plumbing, 200 Amp Panel, Dual Paned Windows, Faux Wood Blinds, Wide Planked Dark Cherry Engineered Wood Floors, Natural Travertine Floors, Surround Sound Throughout (LR, Kitchen, Master Suite, Office, Pool & Court), TVs (optional), Recessed Lights, Solar Tube in Hall, Multiple Closets, Cupboards & Cabinets.   Exterior: PebbleTec Pool w/ Ambient Lighting, Fountains, PV Stone Border, Solar Heating & Bulit-In Speakers. Patio Drains, Rain Gutters, Security Cameras & Alarm System, Wrap Around Balcony, Bamboo Privacy Fence, Pea Gravel Side Yard, Redwood Fence, Mature Hedges, Drought Resistant Plants, Outdoor Lighting & Sprinklers","Tar/Gravel","Dressing Area, Family Room, Formal Entry, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Silver Spur","Peninsula","Palos Verdes","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","APPT ONLY","True","None","False","True","2140","Appraiser","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Via De La Vista","","2","","","Ranch","Submit","","27419","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Bridge(s), City Lights, Harbor, Neighborhood, Panoramic, Vincent Thomas Bridge","True","","","Double Pane Windows","1963","90274","","RERA20000*"
"","0.2026","Please be advised that the property has already been re-listed with our office and will be returning to the MLS shortly. We kindly request that you do not contact the owners directly regarding this property. All inquiries should be directed to the listing agent - Sean @ 310-293-3118","","","176 - Silver Spur","Unknown","True","7546015013","","0","","False","3","1","","","2","3","","Rancho Palos Verdes","#ERR","","","jonbrodriguez@gmail.com","","Jonathan","","","Rodriguez","VRODRJON","","","","","","V7946","310-703-1999","Estate Properties","310-544-9999","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Co-Agent Email","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","122","1999000","#ERR","04/12/2025 3:12:36 PM","","05/31/2025 2:54:48 PM","08/12/2025 12:00:00 AM","08/12/2025 11:06:42 AM","","","04/04/2025 12:00:00 AM","","05/31/2025 2:56:59 PM","","08/12/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","122","","False","","","","","","","","None","False","","True","","","","True","True","Front Door","Supra","False","","","","33.790729","Individual Room","True","False","","","1999000","","","2275000","#ERR","","","seanrodriguez@icloud.com","","Sean","","","Rodriguez","","VRODRSEA","","","","","V7946","310-703-1999","Estate Properties","310-544-9999","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.372539","","2116","8825","Level with Street, Lot 6500-9999","Curbs, Sidewalks","","Assessor","","","PV25080024","","2","2","","1","Vacant","","","","","","","","","28","","None","False","","651.56","Welcome to 26235 Birchfield Drive where sweeping cityscapes meet coastal serenity. This rare 3,068 sq ft single-level retreat sits on an expansive 8,825 sq ft lot in one of the South Bay?s most coveted hillside enclaves, offering breathtaking panoramic views from the Queen?s Necklace to downtown Los Angeles. Step inside to a fresh, inviting interior just painted top-to-bottom inside and out. The open layout is adorned with refinished, sturdy maple hardwood floors  - timeless beauty with lasting durability. Designed for easy, comfortable living, the home features wide hallways, generous doorways, level floor transitions, and spacious rooms, all set on one level for effortless movement throughout. The chef?s kitchen boasts rich cherry cabinetry, abundant counter space, and a central skylight that bathes the room in natural light. Flowing seamlessly from the kitchen are both formal and casual living areas, ideal for intimate gatherings or entertaining a crowd. Three generously sized bedrooms include a primary suite with a walk-in closet, a steam shower, and stunning ocean views that stretch for miles. A large bonus room offers versatile potential - as a home theater, game room, creative studio, or easily configured as guest quarters or a future ADU/in-law suite. The elevated back deck is a true showstopper - perfect for morning coffee, sunset cocktails, or hosting under the stars. The easy-care landscaping keeps yard maintenance minimal, ideal for a lock-and-leave lifestyle. A two-car garage provides ample storage and parking. Located on a peaceful street just minutes from shopping, and award-winning schools, this home offers a rare blend of tranquility, space for visiting family, and that jaw-dropping view you?ll never tire of. Whether you're downsizing in style or looking for room to welcome generations, Birchfield is ready to exceed expectations.","","All Bedrooms Down, Entry, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Text Sean 310-293?3118 day/time of showing then go direct and use lockbox on front door. Do not use ShowingTime. Please submit offer with proof of funds and pre-approval letter. Please no Buyer letters, they will not be submitted to the Seller. Please lock all doors (Back/Front) and turn off lights upon leaving. Property is held in a Trust. Security cameras on premises. P