coastline. Thoughtfully updated and masterfully designed, every detail of the home is crafted to maximize the natural beauty of its surroundings while preserving a sense of privacy and effortless indoor-outdoor living. Light, airy, and functionally elegant, the home?s open floor plan flows gracefully from one space to the next. The kitchen, complete with a cozy breakfast nook, overlooks city views and opens seamlessly into a formal dining room and an expansive family room. Entertain with ease at the built-in wet bar, or showcase your collection in the walk-in wine refrigerator. Oversized sliding glass doors lead to a one-of-a-kind backyard oasis that must be experienced to be fully appreciated. A wide and welcoming hallway leads to the bedroom wing, where the primary suite serves as a peaceful retreat. Featuring dual walk-in closets, a private bath, and breathtaking views, it?s the perfect blend of comfort and luxury. Outdoors, the huge backyard is a haven for relaxation and entertaining. Multiple seating areas provide intimate spaces for conversation around the fire pits or beside a striking stone fireplace, all set against sweeping vistas. A shaded pergola with a mounted big screen TV invites guests to gather and unwind in comfort. The built-in BBQ is perfectly placed so the host can stay in the heart of the action while taking in views of Kings Harbor. A charming rustic bar, custom cornhole court and lush, thoughtfully curated landscaping complete this incredible space. Even the garage is masterfully designed and organized?a true extension of the home?s thoughtful craftsmanship. Built-in custom cabinetry lines the walls, offering plentiful storage without clutter. Durable epoxy floors lend a clean, polished finish, while a dedicated laundry area has been seamlessly integrated for optimal function and flow. It?s as practical as it is refined. This hidden gem is more than a home?it?s a lifestyle, offering serenity, beauty, and connection in one extraordinary package.","","All Bedrooms Down, Bonus Room, Entry, Family Room, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","SELLER DOES NOT WANT TO BE CONTACTED. DO NOT SOLICIT SELLER. Shown by appointment only. Easy to show with a couple hours advance notice. Seller works from home and dog on property, so must have confirmed appointment. Please text George at (310)717-8767 with name, company, DRE# and requested date and time to show.","False","None","False","","2160","Appraiser","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Birchfield","","26228","Avenue","","Traditional","Cash to New Loan","","21169","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Coastline, Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/485316","","","1956","90275","1720","RPRS8000*"
