se energy bills with OWNED SOLAR.  EV charger outlet in the garage.  It doesn't get much better than this lovely home in a quiet, friendly neighborhood.  WELCOME HOME!","Composition","All Bedrooms Down, Entry, Family Room, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Silver Spur","Peninsula","Palos Verdes","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please call or text agent/owner before showing","True","None","False","True","2468","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Whitefox","","5433","Drive","","Traditional","Cash, Conventional, Submit","","21351","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Coastline, Landmark, Ocean, Panoramic, Trees/Woods, Water","True","","","Double Pane Windows, Drapes, Insulated Windows, Plantation Shutters, Roller Shields, Screens, Shutters","1956","90275","2318","RPRS8000*"
