 for a seamless indoor/outdoor flow. All four bedrooms are located in the back of the house - all with high ceilings and tons of space. Retreat back to the primary bedroom complete with a private, ensuite bathroom. Enjoy the ample backyard space ready for the new owners finishing touches. Have we mentioned the garage space? This one has two separate garages! One garage in the front of the house and one at the end of the driveway near the rear of the property - An absolute oasis for auto enthusiasts, but also great for anyone who is passionate about their hobbies. Both garages have been customized by the seller to include vaulted ceilings (with garage doors that follow said vaulted ceilings), 30-amp/110 volt dedicated RV shore power, and a hoist in the rear garage. Other amenities include multiple 50-amp Tesla charging stations and a commercial grade 5-ton York All-In-One package heating/AC unit on the roof.","","All Bedrooms Down, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Workshop","","Palos Verdes / LAUSD ? inquire","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","TEXT or call Nick for showing requests. 310.713.6334","False","","","","1819","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Velez","","1922","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","18968","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","","","","1958","90275","1424","RPRS-4*"
