un throughout the home, complementing the natural light flooding the living & dining rooms through large vinyl clad windows overlooking the South Shores neighborhood lined by serene views. On cooler days, enjoy winding down by the living room wood burning fireplace. Enter the spacious kitchen to find sleek Corinthian counters, recently upgraded appliances and sink, abundant light wood cabinetry and a cozy in-kitchen breakfast bar. Sliding glass doors can be found in two of the three bedrooms that lead out to a Trex outdoor deck overlooking the backyard scenery. Perfect for outdoor living, the spacious backyard is adorned with Sago palms, a peaceful shade-giving tree, redwood fencing, a private footpath that leads to 25th Street and a vegetable garden for those with a green thumb! The two-car garage includes a Tesla charger and ample storage space, as well as an additional workshop area. Several electrical and plumbing updates have been completed including a new breaker box. Close proximity to beautiful Rancho Palos Verdes hikes and outdoor activities, biking and walking distance to the local beaches, shops, and restaurants. This opportunity awaits your discovery.","","Living Room, Workshop","","Los Angeles Unified","White Point","San Pedro","","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Only showing as a LEASE OPPORTUNITY.  Please contact John Accardo:  310-901-2048","True","None","False","","1492","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","One","","","Bowfin Avenue","","2501","","","Mid Century Modern, Traditional","Cash to New Loan","","17400","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","https://youtu.be/KIGNJdMtlpM","","","1954","90732","4621","LAR1"
