Concrete, Garage","True","Brick, Deck, Patio, Porch, Front Porch","True","57","","None","False","","795.85","Exclusive and secluded, this unique lower South Shores custom home is a rare find. Located on a private and tucked away cul-de-sac, this 4 bedroom, 3 bath home sits perched up high on a nearly 12,000 sf lot and offers some of the finest panoramic Pacific ocean and Catalina views in the area. Majestic views with no wire obstruction from nearly every room in this home! Entry level floorplan includes an open kitchen w/pantry, formal dining, sitting area, 1/2 bath, large laundry room and wonderful open family room with built in cabinetry and rustic brick fireplace w/mantle. Kitchen area and family room both open to a tranquil backyard patio area with newer Trex deck and lushly landscaped hillside. Second level features 4 bedrooms, with one full bath and an additional office or craft room. Private primary bedroom and remodeled 3/4 ensuite bath. Lovely mix of hardwood and carpet flooring throughout with newer dual paned windows and French sliding glass doors. Brick walkway, with nicely landscaped front yard, leads up to the main entrance and extended  brick sitting porch area that is ideal for taking in the gorgeous ocean sunsets. Long private driveway with open parking area and an oversized 2 car attached garage with direct home access. Opportunity awaits for a new owner to seize the day!","Composition, Shingle","All Bedrooms Down, Entry, Family Room, Laundry, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite, Office, Separate Family Room","","Los Angeles Unified","","San Pedro","","","","","","","2.5","%","","","False","Full Service","Go direct and please lock all doors and shut lights.","True","None","False","","2072","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Gurnard","","3601","Avenue","","Custom Built","Submit","","19457","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic, W