el includes a formal living area, a spacious dining room, and a chef inspired kitchen with a large island, granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, and natural stone tile floors. A cozy fireplace with additional seating space enhances the warmth of the kitchen. Additionally, the 340 square foot suite bedroom with its own full bath offers a private retreat. Upstairs, enjoy a bright family room with large windows that offer panoramic views of the Pacific Ocean and Catalina Island. The master suite is a true sanctuary, spanning 600 square feet, complete with a walk-in closet and a spa-like bathroom offering serene views. The laundry is conveniently located upstairs, and the walkable attic provides extra storage space. For those needing additional room for projects or storage, the attached 2 car garage has been thoughtfully designed to also accommodate a workshop. Outdoors, the large backyard area is an entertainer's dream, featuring a built-in BBQ, fireplace, and fruit trees?perfect for relaxing or hosting gatherings. This home combines functionality, space, and style to create an ideal living environment for families of all sizes. Don?t miss the opportunity to own this exceptional San Pedro property with spectacular ocean views!","","Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","DO NOT CONTACT OWNER. NEW LISTING AGREEMENT IN PLACE.  Please contact listing agent to schedule a showing. Please allow 24h notice before showing.","False","","","","4328","Assessor","","CA","Canceled","Two","","","Anabas","","2500","Avenue","","","Cash, Cash To Existing Loan, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","17400","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","","","","2010","90732","4620","LAR1"
