dows, and an updated kitchen. The home comes equipped with solar panels, offering immediate energy efficiency and lower utility costs. Enjoy glimpses of the ocean, harbor, and mountains right from your dining area.  The interior features a functional, light-filled layout with well-proportioned bedrooms that serve as a fantastic starting point for a modern renovation. Outside, the property sits on a generous, private sloped lot, offering a variety of landscaping or terracing options to create your own tiered garden or outdoor entertainment oasis. Whether you are an investor looking for your next project, a renovator ready for a transformation, or a primary buyer eager to customize a retreat in a desirable area, take this opportunity to reimagine this classic residence, blending its original character with your own modern vision!","","All Bedrooms Down, Den, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Bathroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showing by appt only, call/text LA","","None","False","","1904","Assessor","","CA","Hold","One","","","Rockinghorse","","96","Road","","","Cash, Conventional, Submit","","18220","","Single Family Residence","","","Harbor, Mountain(s), Ocean","True","","","Double Pane Windows, Skylight(s)","1954","90275","",""
