s the sky. From Catalina Island to Malibu, the panoramic ocean view paints a backdrop that feels unreal. The openness of the ranch-style floor plan draws you naturally into the backyard, where the patio becomes an extension of your everyday life. Whether it is quiet reflection, laughter with family, or simply watching the light dance across the water, this is your peaceful place. Embrace the privacy, a comforting separation from the noise and urgency of the city beyond. Listen to the birds sing and feel the gentle breeze coming off the ocean. The sky shifts through shades of blue, orange and violet, casting a warm glow that fills the space and invites you to pause. The glimmer of the ocean is there to remind you how close you are to something so vast and beautiful. Neighbors stay for years, creating a warm, grounded community that is welcoming and enduring. It is your turn now, and you deserve this special place.","","Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Vista Grande","Palos Verdes","Ridgecrest","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Call (DO NOT TEXT) Rob McGarry at 310.463.8488, then go direct.","True","None","False","","2271","Assessor","","CA","Hold","One","","","Trailriders","","28633","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","27133","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=uSY3fAGGJGT","https://players.brightcove.net/5699924528001/default_default/index.html?videoId=6391268288112","","1964","90275","",""
