,"17","","In Ground","","Close Of Escrow","2040.82","Discover an exceptional opportunity in one of Palos Verdes Estates' most coveted neighborhoods. 2109 Rosita Place is situated on a quiet cul-de-sac in the heart of Malaga Cove, offering a rare chance to own a property with approved architectural plans for a stunning 6 Bed, 8 Bath, 11,182 Sq Ft, new-construction residence. The existing home sits on a beautifully positioned lot, ready for transformation into a masterpiece of design and coastal living. The fully approved plans envision a sophisticated two-story residence with a finished basement, perfectly balancing architectural elegance and the relaxed charm of Southern California.The proposed design features a grand foyer opening to light-filled living and dining areas, a chef's kitchen that flows into the great room and outdoor entertaining space, and thoughtful additions such as a butler's pantry, mudroom, and private office. The upper level is designed with a luxurious primary suite and multiple ensuite bedrooms, while the basement level includes a movie theater, media room, wine cellar, and ample storage. The plans also include a 785 sq ft detached ADU, designed as a private wellness retreat with a home gym, indoor sauna, and serene relaxation space. Outdoors, the envisioned pool and entertaining area create a resort-style atmosphere ideal for gatherings and sun-soaked afternoons.Set among tree-lined streets just moments from Malaga Cove Plaza, coastal trails, and award-winning schools, this property offers the best of Palos Verdes Estates, whether you choose to enjoy the existing home or bring the approved vision to life.","","Bonus Room, Formal Entry, Guest/Maid's Quarters","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Please contact Tony Accardo (310) 855-3557. Showing Information: Combo Lock Box,Go Direct,Supra Lock Box ","True","In Ground","True","","2695","Assessor","","CA","Withdraw