erior paint. Central AC/heating and tankless water heater. New landscaping. Clean, renovated and move-in ready.)  Welcome to the ""Monero Residence,"" a beautifully updated single-level home tucked away on a quiet street in the heart of Rancho Palos Verdes with peek-a-boo views of SoFi Stadium and LA city lights.  Situated on an expansive, private lot, this move-in ready residence offers the ideal blend of comfort, charm, and functionality for family living. The updated kitchen features quartz countertops, stainless steel appliances, a cozy breakfast nook, and a lovely view of the neighborhood. Just beyond, you'll find a spacious living and dining area ideal for hosting guests or relaxing with loved ones. A versatile bonus room with pocket doors can serve as a family room, playroom, or 4th bedroom.  The spacious primary suite includes a bay window, backyard access, and a beautifully renovated ensuite bath with double vanities and a walk-in shower. The second and third bedrooms are generously sized, ideal for kids' rooms, guest rooms, or home offices. All bathrooms have been recently renovated, including a permitted third bathroom addition. Additional upgrades include recessed lighting, crown molding, and included appliances (fridge, washer, dryer). The private backyard is a peaceful retreat surrounded by lush greenery with dedicated areas for a BBQ, firepit, and outdoor seating. It's perfect for family gatherings, entertaining, kids to play, or dogs to roam. Located near top-rated Palos Verdes schools, hiking trails, beaches, golf courses, tennis clubs, and the Peninsula Shopping Center. Zoned for Montemalaga Elementary (9/10), PV Intermediate (10/10), and PV Peninsula High (10/10).","","Bonus Room, Den, Office","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Owner occupied but very easy to show.  Call/text to schedule a private showing or come during an open house. Showing Information: Text LA 1,Call LA 1,Appointment Only,Do 